<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MRK" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Mak</para>
  <para style="toc2">Mak</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mak</para>
  <para style="mt">Mak</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MRK 1" />
  <para style="s">Jon ka mabuno didre, yoba nigl bugl togwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Matyu 3.1-12</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 3:1-9">Luk 3.1-9</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 3:15-17">3.15-17</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Jon 1.19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 1:1" />God Wam Jisas Krais kamo wakai kaima yogwa i, yegl plau dugwa.<verse eid="MRK 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 1:2" />Okna kibo God ka kep yobamo Aisaia dra idre, ye Wam ka ta yegl di togwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 1:2">Ene pro! Na yagl ta kana kep ero dibo, ye ene enatnara ede okna enabiwa. Ye ene enatnara ede okna pi yoba konbauna ake kun erimere yegl erabiwa.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Malakai 3.1</char></note><verse eid="MRK 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 1:3" />Ye dumo wau yomara mogl, ka podo di, yoba yegl di tenabuka, Yagl Kade unabuka pre ene ye konbomo ake kun ersre, ye unabara ake du di edenaiglkwa pamiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aisaia 40.3</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="MRK 1:3">di, yegl di togwa.<verse eid="MRK 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 1:4" />Ana dumere mere Jon nigl bugl togwa yagle ikra udre, dumo wau yomara wan moglkwa. Wan mogl, yoba ye moglmara eigwa i, ake nigl atne ede, ka mabuno di tedre, yoba ta nomano yake tenaiglkwa i, ye i nogugl edinamnedi nigl buraiglme dugwa. Te, ye yegl eribi, God ye tadaglmeno gugl edenabiwe dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 1:5" />Jon ka yegl di moglko, yoba taun Jerusalem we dimara kipai meglkwa i ya distrik Judia suna meglkwa i mere kide ede u Jon moglmara eigwa. Ye moglmara pidre, tadaglmeno di pogl teigo, Jon nigl Jordan moglsre, ye ake nigl atne ede, nigl bugl togwa.<verse eid="MRK 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 1:6" />Ana Jon we, yoba bugla kamel gagno yugo idre, kugugl gagl bekigwa i, edidre, kau nagie kumagl dogwa. Te, ye kaya mokna nogwa i we, mogodo ya brume are nuglo ne wan moglkwa. <verse eid="MRK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 1:7" />Ye yoba nigl bugl tedre, ka yegl di togwa, Yagl ta na moknamugl unabiwa. Yagl i, ye yobuglomo podo padre, na egre atne edugwa. Te, na ama ye nigl kogonmo yoba mere yegl moglsre, ye kagle towo kan i na poko edenaglka kuno erekriwa. <verse eid="MRK 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 1:8" />Na we, na ene nigl mina nigl bugl teiga ba yagl i, kogon ere pere ta ede, Mudu Murubuglo ene si kau si tenabiwe di, Jon yegl dugwa.<verse eid="MRK 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jon ere mogl, Jisas ake nigl atne ede, nigl bugl togwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:13-17">Matyu 3.13-17</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 3:21-22">Luk 3.21-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 1:9" />Ana igne i, Jisas ye taun ta Nasaret we dimara, distrik Galili suna i yogwa, kide kodo, ede u Jon moglmara ugwa. Ye Jon moglmara ugo, Jon ye Jisas nigl Jordan umara ake nigl atne ede, nigl bugl togwa. <verse eid="MRK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 1:10" />Jon ye Jisas nigl bugl te kodugo, Jisas ede meda pi nigle bina moglko, tabre kaima kamun mitna ibo ede u koglo koglo ogo, God Murubuglo u kua yumugl mere yegl pidre, pru di ede atne u Jisas moglmara akugo, Jisas kanugwa. <verse eid="MRK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 1:11" />Kanugo, God heven ibo ka ta di atne edidre, yegl dugwa, Ene na Wana motniwa. Na dena mudna ene tedre, ene wakai kaima kaniwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="MRK 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Satan Jisas kina sugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:1-11">Matyu 4.1-11</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">Luk 4.1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 1:12" />Ana Jisas nigl bugl kodugo, God Murubuglo ere mogl, Jisas oglade agre i ede pi dumo ta wau yomara, yoba moglkrimara ogwa. <verse eid="MRK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 1:13" />Ye Jisas agre i ede wau yomara ogo, Jisas ege 40-pela de agl bugla are meglmara suna wan moglkwa. Wan moglko, Satan ye moglmara u Jisas ta eran kanagledi kina sugo, okuo angelo tau udre, Jisas ake ple digwa.<verse eid="MRK 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas distrik Galili mabuno bogl yoba ka mabuno di togwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:12-17">Matyu 4.12-17</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 4:14-15">Luk 4.14-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 1:14" />Ana okuo King Herot ere mogl, yagl Jon i si kane sugwa. Si kane sugo, mokomugl i Jisas ere mogl, ede distrik ta Galili we dimara suna i pidre, God kamo wakai i, yoba di te, <verse eid="MRK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 1:15" />yegl dugwa, Ege kade ta plau dumiwa. God yoba suglno mogl, kingno morabuka ege i, ede magigl u kodugwa. U kodugwa pre ene nomane kor idre, God kamo wakai i, pre medilo! di, Jisas yoba yegl di togwa.<verse eid="MRK 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas ere mogl, buglo bagle ere sigwa yagle 4-pela di te, Na duglo bolo dugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 1:16" />Ana aglke ta Jisas nigl nubun Galili winabo di udre, kanugwa, agigle agigle suo ta degigl gagl nigle ede, buglo bagle ere si, i pi mige borabugledi ere miurko, kanugwa. Ye kagno Saimon ya Andru we digwa.<figure style="fig" alt="Jesus calling James and John" file="CN01681B.TIF" size="span" loc="1.16" copy="David C Cook" ref="1.16" /> <verse eid="MRK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 1:17" />Jisas ye agle didre, Na duglo boglsro! Na duglo biur, na ene buglo bagle ere si, i suna edibrere kuno yegl, yoba ama yegl auro i suna edenabredi obuno di tenagliwe dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 1:18" />Yegl dugo, yagl suo i degigl gaglno tabre kide kodidre, Jisas omara sika si ede ebrika. <verse eid="MRK 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 1:19" />Ana Jisas kunabe ta ede ido pidre, agigle agigle ta ama miurko, kanugwa. Ye yagl ta Sebedi we digwa i wam suo miurko, kagno Jems ya Jon we digwa. Yagl suo i baglkugl bolamugl moglsre, degigl gaglno i si bogl, ake kun ere miurko, kanugwa. <verse eid="MRK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 1:20" />Ana Jisas yagl suo i kandre, oglade agle dugo, ye neno Sebedi ya kogon yagl bogl akie baglkugl mina meglkwa i kide kodo, Jisas duglo bogl ede ebrika.<verse eid="MRK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas murubuglo kide ta di meda edugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 4:31-37">Luk 4.31-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 1:21" />Ana Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yagl i bogl akie ede dumo Kaperneam suna eigwa. Pi suna meglko, wakan kade ege yogwa. Wakan kade yogo, Jisas ede ka mabuno yugu yugugl pi, yoba ka mabuno di togwa. <verse eid="MRK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 1:22" />Di togo, yoba prisre, nagino keglkwa. I siragl pre ye ka beke togwa i, God lomo beke teigwa yoba dimere yegl ta dikrukwa. Ta manugwa. Ye yene kagie kade paugwa mere yegl dugwa.<verse eid="MRK 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 1:23" />God kamo beke togo, yagl ta murubuglo kide moglkwa tabre ede yugugl udre, ka podo didre, <verse eid="MRK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 1:24" />Aya, Jisas ene Nasaret nem motnga i, no siragl ere nora une? No ere kide ere nora uno mo? Te, ene ira motnga i, na pre kan erie dugwa. Ene God Kere Yugl Yagl ikra motniwe dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 1:25" />Murubuglo kide i yegl dugo, Jisas ka gigledi yegl di togwa, Ene dran si kegl didre, yagl i moglmara kide kodo ede meda wo dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 1:26" />Dugo, murubuglo kide yagl i ogo gagie ake pru dinabedi ersre, kaglkane idre, ede meda ogwa. <verse eid="MRK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 1:27" />Ede ogo, yoba mudu nagino kogl, di ikne ikne ede pre, yegl digwa, Yagl i, ka kor ta yu di norumiwe digwa. Didre, Ye ama yagl kade mere yegl ta moglsre, ka yobuglo bogl dugo, murubuglo kide ama ye kamo duglo beglmiwe digwa. <verse eid="MRK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 1:28" />Yegl didre, ede meda wigwa igne, Jisas kamo di wai digo, yoba distrik Galili suna kipaigwa i, mudu prikwa.<verse eid="MRK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pita abu imakie kide sugo, Jisas ere wakai ere togwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:14-15">Matyu 8.14-15</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 4:38-39">Luk 4.38-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 1:29" />Ana Jisas yogo, Jems ya Jon yebriko, Saimon ya Andru yebriko, ye ka mabuno yugu kide kodo, tabre ede pi Saimon ya Andru kipabrara ede yugugl eigwa. <verse eid="MRK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 1:30" />Eigo, Saimon ebie mam nagie niga podo dugo, yugugl ugl pai moglkwa. Ugl pai moglko, ye duglo beglkwa yagl tabre Jisas di teigo, <verse eid="MRK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 1:31" />Jisas pi Saimon imakie ugl pai moglmara ogo ake aduglko, ye kidemo bu yogwa. Bu yogo, abumo i, tabre adigl, kaya mokna nenaiglmedi ere wakai ere gaglkwa.<verse eid="MRK 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas yoba mere kaima kideno ere wakai ere togwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:16-17">Matyu 8.16-17</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 4:40-41">Luk 4.40-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 1:32" />Ana ade ede prak ogwa igne, yoba ere mogl, yoba kide sigwa ya murubuglo kide ye meglmara suna meglkwa i mudu auro yu Jisas moglmara wigo, <verse eid="MRK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 1:33" />yoba dumo Kaperneam kipaigwa i, mudu u yugu dramugl kau si meglkwa. <verse eid="MRK 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 1:34" />Kau si meglko, Jisas yoba kide kane kane sigwa i tau mere ere wakai ere tedre, te yoba murubuglo kide ye meglmara suna meglkwa i, mere kide di meda edidre, erukwa. Di meda edidre, murubuglo kide ye Jisas ira moglkwa i, pre pogl sigwa pre ye ira moglkwa i di nogugl ede dinaiglmedi Jisas mane dugwa.<verse eid="MRK 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas distrik Galili suna wan mogl, yoba dumo pere pere kipaigwa i, ka mabuno di togwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 4:42-44">Luk 4.42-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 1:35" />Ana tagna ta i, Jisas eduer kana adigl ede meda pi, dumo wau yomara ta pi kamage ere moglkwa. <verse eid="MRK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 1:36" />Kamage ere moglko, Saimon ye yagl kunama bogl Jisas dokigwa. <verse eid="MRK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 1:37" />Ye Jisas dokidre, kanigwa igne ye yegl di teigwa, Yoba mere kide ene dokime digwa. <verse eid="MRK 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 1:38" />Yegl digwa ba Jisas di ikne ede te, yegl dugwa, Na yoba bina dage atne kipaigwa i ama ka mabuno di tenaglka paugwa pre nono ede enamga. Na kogon yegl eraglka pre wiwe dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 1:39" />Yegl dugo, ye distrik Galili suna wan ede bage bage eigo, Juda yoba ka mabuno yuguno yomara i, ka mabuno di tedre, murubuglo kide yoba meglmara suna meglkwa i di meda edidre, erukwa.<verse eid="MRK 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas yagl ta leprosi erukwa ere wakai ere togwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Matyu 8.1-4</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 5:12-16">Luk 5.12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 1:40" />Ana aglke ta yagl ta kede kaglade sugwa u Jisas moglmara goglko bodugl, Jisas di pre, yegl dugwa, Yagl Kade yo, ene na ta ere wakai ere naragledi pitn, eratnga i kuno erabiwe di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 1:41" />Yegl dugo, Jisas yagl i mirie goglsre, ogo duglo si yagl i akidre, ye yegl di togwa, Na ene ere wakai ere tenagledi prika. Ene u kor po! dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 1:42" />Yegl dugo, kede kaglade sugwa ikra oglade bu yogo, ye ogo gagie yoko yogwa. <verse eid="MRK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 1:43" />Ogo gagie yoko yogo, Jisas ye tabre dedidre, ka giglede yegl di togwa, <verse eid="MRK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 1:44" />Na siragl mere erika i, ene pi yoba swara ta di tekro! Ene pi ogon nagin tawa togwa yagle morabara obuno di tenatniwe di, yegl dugwa. Te, Moses okna yoba kede kaglade sigwa u kor eigwa igne tawa tenaiglme dumere yegl yoba ene u kor enga i, kan pogl sinaiglkwa pre tawa to! di, Jisas yegl dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 1:45" />Jisas yegl dugwa ba yagl ikra pi yoba mere kide kaima di togo, prikwa. Ka i prisre, yoba mere kide ede Jisas moglmara enamnedi erikwa pre Jisas ede taun nogugl unabuka kuno erekrukwa. Kuno erekruko, ye yoba ta kipai moglkrimara wan moglkwa. Wan moglko, yoba dumo bage bage kipaigwa i, mere kide kaima ye moglmara eigwa.<verse eid="MRK 1:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MRK 2" />
  <para style="s">Jisas yagl ta ogo kagle mawa sugwa ere wakai erukwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Matyu 9.1-8</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Luk 5.17-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 2:1" />Jisas ege tau wan mogl, aglke ede ikne u taun Kaperneam we dimara ugwa. Ugo, yoba ere mogl, Jisas kipamara ikne ume digo, ka wai dugo, <verse eid="MRK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 2:2" />yoba mere kide prisre, ede u Jisas yugugl moglmara ikra wigwa. U yugugl ya yugu dramugl i kau si kodigwa. Kau si kodigo, Jisas ye ka mabuno di togwa. <verse eid="MRK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 2:3" />Ka mabuno di te moglko, yagl 4-pela ere mogl, yagl ta kagle goglkwa gagle ersre, boglo ere i pi Jisas moglmara eigwa. <verse eid="MRK 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 2:4" />Boglo ere i pi yugugl enamnedi eigo, yugugl ya yugu dramugl i yoba kau si, gagno bolamugl kaima meglkwa pre ye aglke ede u idaule pidre, idaule taragl tau terke i eglke edidre, yagl i gagle bogl ede atne Jisas moglmara edigwa.<figure style="fig" alt="Lowering paralytic through roof" file="FM 151 Friends Lower Man_6inches_BW.jpg" size="col" loc="2.4" copy="Foundation Matters" ref="2.4" /> <verse eid="MRK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 2:5" />Ede atne edigo, yagl wagle Jisas pre mediglkwa i, Jisas kandre, yagl kagle goglkwa i di te, Wana yo, ene tadaglmenen gugl ede teiwe dugwa.<verse eid="MRK 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 2:6" />Ana Jisas ka yegl dugo, God lomo beke teigwa yagl tau yugugl ame di meglkwa i, prisre, ye nomano wagle yegl di prikwa, <verse eid="MRK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 2:7" />Yagl i siragl pre ka yegl dume? Ye God agaimo idre, kagie ere kide erukwa. God swara yoba tadaglmeno gugl edenabiwe di, yegl di prikwa. <verse eid="MRK 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 2:8" />Yegl priko, Jisas ye deno muduno mina prikwa i, ye nomane mina kwade kandre, yegl dugwa, Ene siragl pre nomano mina yegl di pre meglme? dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 2:9" />Na siragl ka dibo yuwaglke panabedi prime? Yagl kagle goglkwa i di tedre, Tadaglmenen gugl ede teie dibo, yuwaglke panabo mo yagl i di tedre, adigl kuguglnen akidre, konbauna ede po dibo, yuwaglke panabedi prime? <verse eid="MRK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 2:10" />Na ene yoba tadaglmeno gugl ede tekrabedi prikwa ba na Yoba Wam moglka i, yoba tadaglmeno gugl ede tenaglka i, kagna paugwa pre erme taragl ta eribo, kan pogl sinaiglmiwe dugwa. Jisas yegl didre, yagl ta ogo kagle goglkwa i yegl di togwa, <verse eid="MRK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 2:11" />Na ene di teiga, ene adigl, kuguglnen akidre, ede kipanara po! dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 2:12" />Yegl dugo, yagl i tabre kaima yoba gumuglno mina adigl, kuguglmo akidre, ede meda ogo, yoba kan meglkwa i, gagno koglsre, God kagie kade tedre, yegl digwa, Nono taragl yegl mere okna ta kankrumnere kamniwe di, yegl digwa.<verse eid="MRK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas Livai agle didre, Na duglo boglo dugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Matyu 9.9-13</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Luk 5.27-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 2:13" />Ana Jisas ere mogl, aglke ede ikne pi nigl nubun Galili we dimara bina pi moglko, yoba mere kide ye moglmara ede eigwa. Eigo, Jisas ye ka mabuno di togwa. <verse eid="MRK 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 2:14" />Di te kodidre, ye konbauna wan pidre, taks yugwa yagl ta taks imara ame di moglko, kanugwa. Yagl i, kagie Livai we digo, Alfius wam moglkwa. Ana Jisas yagl i kandre, ye di te, Na duglo boglo dugo, Livai adiglsre, Jisas omara duglo bogl ede ogwa.<verse eid="MRK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 2:15" />Ana okuo Jisas ede Livai kipamara pidre, kaya mokna nenagledi ame di moglko, taks igwa yoba yeigo, tadaglme erikwa yoba ama yeigo, Jisas duglo beglkwa yagl bogl akie kaya mokna neigwa. I siragl pre Jisas ye aglo mere ta ogwa i, taks igwa yagl ya ka mabuno prikrikwa yoba tau mere ege ege sika sigwa. <verse eid="MRK 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 2:16" />Ne meglko, Farisi tau yeigo, Farisi yoba God lomo beke teigwa i, i ama u ne meglkwa kandre, Jisas duglo beglkwa yagl yegl di prikwa, Siragl pre Jisas taks igwa yoba ya tadaglme yoba bogl kaya mokna akie neime? digwa. <verse eid="MRK 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 2:17" />Yegl digo, Jisas prisre, di ikne ede yegl dugwa, Yoba kide sikrukwa i, ye dokta moglmara enaiglkwa kuno erekrumiwa. Ba yoba kide sigwa i keme dokta moglmara enaiglkwa kuno erukwa. Kuno yegl mere na yoba du munedi prikwa i, agle dinagledi ukrika ba na tadaglme yoba agle dinagledi wiwe dugwa.<verse eid="MRK 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yoba kaya mokna mawagl erikwa pre kira peglkwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Matyu 9.14-17</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Luk 5.33-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 2:18" />Ana igne i Jon duglo beglkwa yagl ya Farisi yoba ye God we di pre, kaya mokna mawagl ere meglkwa. Kaya mokna mawagl ere meglkwa pre yoba tau Jisas moglmara udre, yegl digwa, Jon duglo beglkwa yagl ya Farisi duglo beglkwa yagl bogl kaya mokna mawagl erikwa ba siragl eruko, ene duglo beglkwa yoba kaya mokna mawagl erekrime? digwa. <verse eid="MRK 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 2:19" />Yegl digo, Jisas ka ebrie ta ama yegl dugwa, Yagl abu ta bogl ibr, yagl kabaglemo ye bogl akie gun yei moraiglkwa igne i, kaya mokna mawagl eraiglmo? Ta erekraiglkwa. I siragl pre ye abu yugwa yagl bogl akie mogl, kaya mokna nenaiglkwa ege yogwa. <verse eid="MRK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 2:20" />Ba abu yugwa yagl i auro ede enaiglkwa igne i, ege i ye kabaglemo kaya mokna mawagl eraiglmiwe dugwa.<verse eid="MRK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mabuno okna ya mabuno kor u swara pikrabuka pre Jisas dugwa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 2:21" />Ana Jisas yegl didre, ka ebrie ama yegl dugwa, Yoba kuguglmo gaglmo goglo ta argla dinan, ye lap kor ta bogl i pi si boglkrabuka. I siragl pre lap kor i gugl sidre, argla di ede podo kaima enabuka. <verse eid="MRK 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 2:22" />Te, yoba nigl wain kor ta morabuka i, ta i pi toide nigl mige goglo mina atne edekrabuka. Toide atne edenan, nigl wain kor i, poia didre, nigl mige goglo i si bla dinabuka. Yegl eran, nigl wain toide ede meda enan, nigl mige i ama ere kide erabuka. Yegl pre nigl wain kor ta morabuka i, yoba i pi toide nigl mige kor mina atne edinaiglmiwe dugwa.<verse eid="MRK 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Farisi yoba wakan kade pre kira peglkwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Matyu 12.1-8</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Luk 6.1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 2:23" />Ana wakan kade ege ta, Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yagl bogl konbauna ta wan ede pi yoba kugl mogo ere yaiglmara suna eigwa. Ye ede suna eigo, ye duglo beglkwa yagl kidan gogl, kugl mogo tau ake digl di idre, nedre, nedre, ede eigwa. <verse eid="MRK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 2:24" />Ake digl di i neigo, Farisi yoba tau kandre, ye di te, yegl digwa, Ene duglo beglkwa yagl erima, kano! Siragl pre Wakan Kade ege mawagl pamara kugl mogo si yuime? digwa. <verse eid="MRK 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 2:25" />Yegl digo, Jisas di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Okna ibo Devit ya yoba tau ye bogl akie meglkwa i, kaya mokna yeikruko, kidan geglko, Devit siragl mere erukwa i, ene kerimo mo kerekrime? <verse eid="MRK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 2:26" />Yagl Abiatar ye tawa teigwa yoba bitno moglkwa igne, Devit God yugumo yomara ede yugugl pidre, bret tau God gumuglo mina yeigwa i tau i nedre, yoba ye bogl akie meglkwa i ama tau togo, neigwa. <verse eid="MRK 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 2:27" />God wakan kade i pere edugwa i, ye yoba mawagl pamara atne kane panaiglkwa pre i pere edekrukwa. Yoba wakan meglbi, ame wakai dinaiglkwa pre i pere edugwa. <verse eid="MRK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 2:28" />Kuno yegl mere na Yoba Wam moglka i, Wakan Kade ege i, na Nem Yagl moliwe dugwa.<verse eid="MRK 2:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MRK 3" />
  <para style="s">Wakan kade ege Jisas yagl ogo mawa sugwa ta ere wakai erukwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Matyu 12.9-14</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Luk 6.6-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 3:1" />Ana ege ta Jisas ka mabuno yugu ta ama yugugl ogo, yagl ta ogo koglo mawa sugwa ama yugugl moglkwa. <verse eid="MRK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 3:2" />Ana Farasi yoba ye wakai ere kan moglsre, Jisas wakan kade ege i, yagl i ta ere wakai ere tenan, ene mawagl pamara etniwedi didre, kot ere tenamnedi kan meglkwa. <verse eid="MRK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 3:3" />Kan meglko, Jisas yagl ta ogo mawa sugwa i di tedre, Ene ede yoba gumanomugl wo dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 3:4" />Ede u ogo, Jisas Farisi yoba ikra yegl di prukwa, Wakan kade ege i, God lomo duglo boglsre, nono siragl eramne? Mabuno wakai eramno mo mabuno kide eramne? Te, wakan kade ege nono yoba ere inamno mo yoba si goramne? di, yegl dugwa. Yegl dugwa ba Farisi yoba i ye ka di ikne edekriko, <verse eid="MRK 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 3:5" />Jisas kan winabo didre, kanugwa i, ye ka prikramnedi nomano gigle dugwa pre Jisas dem kubruko, dem muduo ama yubun dogwa. Yubun dogo, ye yagl ogo mawa sugwa i di te, Ene ogon duglo suo! dugwa. Dugo, yagl i ogo duglo sugo, ye ogo u wakai ogwa. <verse eid="MRK 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 3:6" />Yegl eruko, kandre, Farisi yoba oglade ede meda pi Herot yobama i bogl makai sidre, Jisas siragl mere ere kide ere tenaiglmere i pre ka di keglkwa.<verse eid="MRK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas ede nigle bina ogo, yoba mere kide ye mokomugl eigwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:17-19">Luk 6.17-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 3:7" />Ana Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yagl bogl dumo i kide kodidre, ede pi nigl nubun Galili bina eigwa. Eigo, Galili yoba mere kide ye eimara mokonomugl sika si ede eigwa. <verse eid="MRK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 3:8" />Yoba distrik Judia kipai meglkwa ya te, dumo Jerusalem ya dumo makan Idumea ya nigl koglo Jordan kipai meglkwa ya te, dumo Tair ya Saidon yebrara magigl kipai meglkwa i, ye mere kide Jisas siragl taragl erukwa i yoba digo, prisre, ye moglmara eigwa. <verse eid="MRK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 3:9" />Yoba mere kide ye moglmara u moko guma eraiglkwa paugwa pre Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yagl di te, Baglkugl ta yu magigl wio dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 3:10" />I siragl pre ye yoba mere kaima kideno ere wakai ere togwa pre yoba mudu kide sigwa i, Jisas akenamnedi ake nu sigwa. <verse eid="MRK 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 3:11" />Te, yoba murubuglo kide ye meglmara suna meglkwa i ama Jisas kanigwa igne i ye ege ege yage kobragai padre, ka podo di, Ene God Wam motniwe digwa. <verse eid="MRK 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 3:12" />Yegl digwa ba Jisas ye yoba ira moglkwa i, yoba di te dinaiglmedi murubuglo kide ka giglede di tedre, mane di togwa.<verse eid="MRK 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas yagl 12-pela dedenagledi kere yugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Matyu 10.1-4</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Luk 6.12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 3:13" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="Jesus and 12 disciples" file="CN01699B.TIF" size="span" copy="David C Cook" ref="3.13" />Ana Jisas ere mogl, ede muglo ibo pidre, ye yoba ta ye moglmara unaiglmedi prukwa i, agle dugo, wigwa. <verse eid="MRK 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 3:14" />Wigo, ye yagl 12-pela kere idre, yoba i, Jisas kere iga yoba meglmiwe dugwa. Yagl 12-pela kere yugwa i, ye bogl akie moraiglkwa pre ya te, Jisas ye dedenan, ye ede pi yoba ka mabuno di tedre, <verse eid="MRK 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 3:15" />murubuglo kide yoba meglmara suna moraiglkwa i, Jisas ye yobuglo tenan, ye di meda edenaiglkwa pre kere yugwa. <verse eid="MRK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 3:16" />Ye yagl 12-pela kere yugwa i, swara ta Saimon moglkwa. Te, Jisas ye kagie kor ta yei tedre, Pita we dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 3:17" />Te, yagl Sebedi wam suo kere yugwa, kagno Jems ya Jon we digwa. Jisas ere mogl, Jems ya Jon suo akie kagno ta Boanerges we dugwa. Kagno Boanerges i, mabuno yegl, kamun gur dugwa yagl mere yegl miurka. <verse eid="MRK 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 3:18" />Te, Jisas yagl tau ama kere yugwa, kagno Andru ya Filip ya Bartolomyu ya Matyu ya Tomas ya Jems we digwa. Jems i, ye yagl ta kagie Alfius we digwa i wam moglkwa. Te, ye ama Tadius ya Saimon kere yugwa. Saimon i, ye Selot<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Selot yoba i, ye Rom yoba kuda bogl tedre, Israel yoba mogl pere edinamnedi prikwa yoba meglkwa. </char></note> yoba ta moglkwa. <verse eid="MRK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 3:19" />Te, ye ama Judas Iskariot kere yugwa. Yagl Judas i, okuo ye Jisas i pi kudamo ikne ogono mina yogwa.<verse eid="MRK 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yoba Jisas Satan yobuglo togo, kogon erume digwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:24-32">Matyu 12.24-32</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Luk 11.14-23</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 12:10">12.10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 3:20" />Ana Jisas ede ikne kipamara ogo, yoba mere kide aglke kor ye moglmara u makai sigwa. Yoba mere kide makai si meglkwa pre Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yagl bogl kaya mokna nenaiglkwa kuno ta erekrukwa. <verse eid="MRK 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 3:21" />Yegl eruko, yoba tau Jisas kogon podo kide yegl erume digo, Jisas nem agiglema prisre, Jisas du erukwa pamiwe didre, ye pi agre i ede unamnedi Jisas moglmara eigwa.<verse eid="MRK 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 3:22" />Ana God lomo beke teigwa yagl tau Jerusalem mogl udre, yegl digwa, Jisas we, murubuglo kide di meda ede wan moglkwa i, Belsebul,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ye Belsebul we digwa i, mabuno paugwa, diun bitno moglkwa. I Satan pre ye kagie ta yeigwa. </char></note> murubuglo kide bitno moglkwa ikra, ye moglmara suna moglsre, yobuglo togo, Jisas di meda edumiwe di, yegl digwa. <verse eid="MRK 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 3:23" />Yegl digo, Jisas yoba i ye moglmara Magigl wio! dugo, wigwa. Wigo, ye ka padum tau di, yegl dugwa, Satan yene ere mogl, yene di meda edenan, kuno erabo? dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 3:24" />Te, yoba ta dumo swara moraiglkwa i, yene si buno di ede suo pidre, kuda beglbi, ye u kide enaiglkwa. <verse eid="MRK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 3:25" />Mo, yoba bormai swara meglkwa i, yene ikne ikne kuda beglbi, ye ama u kide enaiglkwa. <verse eid="MRK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 3:26" />Kuno yegl mere, Satan yugobunomo mina yene kuda beglbi, ye yugobunomo dudinan, ye yobuglomo ama dudunabuka pamiwe dugwa.<verse eid="MRK 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 3:27" />Jisas ka ta ama yegl dugwa, Yagl Kide yobuglomo podo paugwa i, yugumo sugl moran, yoba ta ye taraglmo inagledi eran, ta kuno erekrabuka. Ba yoba ta ye taraglmo inagledi pran, ye komono kana ogo kagle kan si padiglsre, okuo ye taraglmo mudu ta yugugl yenabuka i, inabiwe dugwa.<verse eid="MRK 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 3:28" />Yegl pre na ene ka kaima di teiga, yoba tadaglme siragl mere ta eraiglkwa ya God ka kide di tenaiglkwa i, God ye gugl ede tenabuka <verse eid="MRK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 3:29" />ba yoba ta Mudu Murubuglo di kide yei tenan, God ye tadaglmemo i, gugl ede tekrabuka. Aimadi kamin pai morabiwe di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 3:30" />Yoba tau ye murubuglo kide ta ye moglmara suna moglme digwa pre Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="MRK 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas mam ya agiglema wigwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Matyu 12.46-50</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Luk 8.19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 3:31" />Ana Jisas ka yegl di kodugo, Jisas mam ya agiglema u meda adigl mogl, Jisas unan, ka di tenamnedi ka di yugugl edigwa. <verse eid="MRK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 3:32" />Di edigo, yoba mere kide Jisas moglmara ame di mogl winabo digwa i, ye yegl di teigwa, Ene pro, ene man ya agitn abatnma meda mogl, ene ka di tenamnedi sugl kan meglmiwe digwa. <verse eid="MRK 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 3:33" />Yegl digo, Jisas di ikne ede yegl di togwa, Na mana ya agrama ira meglmedi prime? dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 3:34" />Didre, ye yoba ye moglmara ame di mogl, winabo digwa i mudu kandre, yegl dugwa, Kanio. Yoba i na mana ya agrama meglkwa. <verse eid="MRK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 3:35" />I siragl pre yoba ira ta God kamo prisre, duglo boraiglkwa i keme na agrama moglsre, abarama moglsre, manama moglsre, erimiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="MRK 3:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MRK 4" />
  <para style="s">Yagl ta kugl mogo suduglkwa ka ebrie</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:1-19">Matyu 13.1-19</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Luk 8.4-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 4:1" />Ana Jisas aglke kor nigl nubun bina mogl, yoba God kamo beke togwa. Beke te moglko, yoba mere kide ye moglmara eigwa pre ye aglke kor ede baglkugl mina ede egli pi ame dugo, yoba mere kide nigle bina adigl meglkwa. <verse eid="MRK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 4:2" />Adigl meglko, Jisas ka ebrie mere kaima beke togwa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 4:2">
    <figure style="fig" alt="The Sower" file="FM 156 The Sower_6inches_BW.jpg" size="col" copy="Foundation Matters" ref="4.2" />Ta dugwa i, yegl dugwa, <verse eid="MRK 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 4:3" />Ene prio! Yagl ta kugl mogo i pi suduragledi ede ogwa. <verse eid="MRK 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 4:4" />Kugl mogo i pi sudugl ake pia sugo, kugl mogo tau yage konbauna sigwa. Kugl mogo i, kua pru di u neigwa. <verse eid="MRK 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 4:5" />Te, tau, yage makan gaba kuri ta kobuglo bolamugl moglmara yage sigwa. Kugl mogo i, makan gaba mere yeikrumara yage sigwa pre tabre parikwa <verse eid="MRK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 4:6" />ba ade ede mitna ugwa igne, duglane ede atne pikrukwa pre kugl i tabre ade de, yaminugwa. <verse eid="MRK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 4:7" />Te, tau yage kan kagigle yaglkwa bogl moglmara sigwa. Kugl mogo i pare wi sigo, kan kagigle yaglkwa i ama akie pare ede mitna pi, kugl i atne edugo, kugl i mogo ta koglkrikwa. <verse eid="MRK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 4:8" />Te, kugl mogo tau yage makan wakai yomara sigwa. Kugl mogo i, pare ede mitna pi, mogo wakai koglkwa. Tau 30 keglko, tau 60 keglko, tau 100 keglmiwe di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 4:9" />Didre, ama ka ta yegl dugwa, Yoba na kana ta pramnedi praiglkwa i, na ka diga i wakai ere kinano gudu prio! dugwa.<verse eid="MRK 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas siragl pre ka ebrie dugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Matyu 13.10-17</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 8:9-10">Luk 8.9-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 4:10" />Ana okuo Jisas yagl 12-pela ye duglo beglkwa yagl i yeigo, te yoba tau ye ama duglo beglkwa i yene moglsre, ye Jisas ka ebrie tau dugwa i mabuno pramnedi kira pogl prikwa. <verse eid="MRK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 4:11" />Kira pogl priko, Jisas ye di te, yegl dugwa, God yoba kingno morabuka kamo mem teke paugwa i, ye ene pre pogl sinaiglmedi pra we dugwa ba yoba meda meglkwa i, ka ebrie keme di tebo, praiglmiwe di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 4:12" />Na ka ebrie keme dinaglka i, ye kan kan eraiglkwa ba kan pogl sikraiglkwa pre diga. Te, ye pre pre eraiglkwa ba pre pogl sikraiglkwa pre diga. Te, ye nomane kor ibi, God ye tadaglmeno gugl ede dinabedi yegl diwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aisaia 6.9-10</char></note> dugwa.<verse eid="MRK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yagl ta kugl mogo suduglkwa ka ebrie i, Jias mabuno di nogugl edugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Matyu 13.18-23</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 8:11-15">Luk 8.11-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 4:13" />Ana Jisas ka yegl didre, ka ta ama yegl dugwa, Na ka ebrie swara ta kugl mogo pre erme diga i, ene pre pogl sikribi, ka ebrie tau okuo dinaglka i, ene siragl mere pre pogl sinaiglme? <verse eid="MRK 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 4:14" />Na yagl ta kugl mogo suduglme diga i, yoba ta God kamo di togwa mere yegl moglkwa. <verse eid="MRK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 4:15" />Te, kugl mogo tau yage konbauna sime diga i, yoba tau God kamo prikwa ba Satan oglade u ye ka prikwa i, nomano mina i eglke edugwa. <verse eid="MRK 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 4:16" />Te, kugl mogo tau yage kobuglo moglmara sime diga i, yoba tau God kamo prikwa igne, ye tabre pre idre, gun yeigwa. <verse eid="MRK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 4:17" />Ba duglane ede atne pikrumere mere yegl meglkwa pre ye ege sugunagle keme ka prikwa pre ka primara pre yubun ta teigwa mo ye ere sibi, ye tabre yage sinaiglkwa. <verse eid="MRK 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 4:18" />Te kugl mogo tau yage kan kagigle yaglkwa boglmara sime diga i, yoba tau God kamo prikwa <verse eid="MRK 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 4:19" />ba ye erme mogl pai eraiglkwa i ya, mige moni mere kan yenaiglkwa i ya, bona gana kane kane sinaiglkwa pre i mitna edigwa pre kan kagigle yaglkwa i kugl i atne edumere mere yegl, taragl i ye nomano mina kau sugo, ye mogo wakai ta koglkrikwa. <verse eid="MRK 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 4:20" />Te, tau yage makan wakai yomara sime diga i, yoba tau God kamo wakai pre, duglo bogl, mogo wakai keglkwa. Tau ki 30 keglko, tau ki 60 keglko, tau ki 100 yegl keglmiwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="MRK 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yoba ken gaglsre, degigl gagl mina atne yeikraiglkwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 8:16-18">Luk 8.16-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 4:21" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="Lamp" file="hk00151b.tif" size="col" copy="Horace Knowles, British Foreign and Bible Society" ref="4.21" />Jisas ka ta ama yegl di togwa, Yoba ken gagl yu degigl gagl mina atne edimo? Mo, lam beyemo mina padigl, nogugl yeikre, yu bogl atne yeimo? <verse eid="MRK 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 4:22" />Kuno yegl mere ka siragl mere ta teke paugwa mo yoba pre pogl sikrikwa i, okuo ede nogugl unan, yoba pre pogl sinaiglkwa keme pre paugwa. <verse eid="MRK 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 4:23" />Yoba na kana ta pramnedi pribi, wakai ere kinano gudu prio! dugwa.<verse eid="MRK 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 4:24" />Jisas ka yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Ene ka erme prikwa i, wakai ere kinano gudu prio! Ene siragl mere ka i kinano gudu pre yubu sigwa i, God kuno yegl mere ene nomano tedre, nomane tau ama i tebe ede tenabiwe dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 4:25" />Yoba tau na kana wakai ere kinano gudu praiglkwa i, God ye nomane tau te tebe edenabiwe dugwa. Ba yoba tau na kana wakai ere kinano gudu prikraiglkwa i, ye nomane kebra ta igwa i, God i eglke edenabiwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="MRK 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kugl mogo wi si parukwa ka ebrie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 4:26" />Ana Jisas ka ebrie ta ama yegl dugwa, God yoba kingno mogl, ye suglno morabuka ege i, siragl mere unabuka i, yegl mere pamiwe dugwa. Yagl ta kugl mogo suduglkwa mere yegl paugwa. Yagl i kugl mogo i pi makan mina suduglsre, <verse eid="MRK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 4:27" />ye eduer ugl pai, tagna mogl adigl, yegl ere ogo, kugl mogo i yene pare, wi si ede mitna ogwa. Kugl mogo siragl mere pare, wi si erukwa i, yagl mogo suduglkwa i ta pre pogl sikrukwa. <verse eid="MRK 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 4:28" />Makan yene eruko, kugl i mogo keglkwa. Komno kana kugl pare wi si ede mitna pidre, okuo mogo ninie ere kogl, okuo kaima i mogo de, bogl yome dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 4:29" />Ana mogo dogwa igne, yagl ikra ye si inabuka egemo yogwa pre ye oglade si yumiwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="MRK 4:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ede mastet mogomo ka ebrie</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:31-32">Matyu 13.31-32</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 13:18-19">Luk 13.18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 4:30" />Ana Jisas ka ta ama yegl dugwa, God yoba kingno mogl, suglno morabuka i, siragl mere panabe dinamne? Mo ka ebrie siragl mere di boramne? <verse eid="MRK 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 4:31" />I ede mastet mogomo mere yegl ta pame dinaglka. Yagl ta mastet mogo ta i pi kaya mokna ere yaglmara suna yaglkwa. Ana mastet mogo i, kebra kaima yedre, kaya mokna mogo tau togwa <verse eid="MRK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 4:32" />ba mastet pare ede mitna ogwa igne, ede mere yegl pai, kaya mokna mudu egre i atne ede, yogagle kade sugo, bogume yogwa pre kua tau mere u yugo bagl paimiwe dugwa.<verse eid="MRK 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">God kamo i, Jisas ka ebrie keme di togwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:34-35">Matyu 13.34-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33-34" style="v" sid="MRK 4:33-34" />Ana Jisas ka ebrie yegl tau mere didre, yoba mudu God kamo ka ebrie keme di togwa. Ka ebrie di tomara i, yoba ye pre pogl sinaiglkwa kuno erabuka yegl mere di togwa. Yoba ka ebrie keme di togwa ba ye yene duglo beglkwa yagl i bogl akie meglkwa igne, ye ka ebrie dugwa i mabunomo di nogugl ede togwa.<verse eid="MRK 4:33-34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas ka dugo, ir waga kudu ugwa bu yogwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Matyu 8.23-27</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Luk 8.22-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 4:35" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="Storm" file="CN01707B.TIF" size="col" copy="David C Cook" ref="4.35" />Ana ege swara i min paugo, Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yagl di tedre, Nono ede nigl nubun koglo ibo omno dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 4:36" />Ye baglkugl kuglo mogl, ka yegl dugwa pre ye duglo beglkwa yagl yoba mere kide meglmara i kide kodidre, Jisas auro i ede koglo ibo enamnedi baglkugl wagle eigwa. Te, yoba tau baglkugl tau ama idre, pere eigwa. <verse eid="MRK 4:36" /><verse number="37-38" style="v" sid="MRK 4:37-38" />Ana ye ede nigle suna eigo, Jisas ye baglkugl mokomugl mogl, ede iko ta yei, ugl pai moglkwa. Ugl pai moglko, ir waga kudu podo ta ugo, nigl si pepigl di, u baglkugl wagle si kau sinagledi erukwa. Yegl eruko, ye duglo beglkwa yagl ye uglo yoko, yegl digwa, Neno Yagle, no goramga i, ene prikitno? di, yegl digwa. <verse eid="MRK 4:37-38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 4:39" />Yegl digo, Jisas adiglsre, ir waga kudu ikra ka tedre, nigl sugwa i di te, Kiede moglo! dugwa. Dugo, ir ugwa i dudugo, nigl ama kiede kaima moglkwa. <verse eid="MRK 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 4:40" />Yegl eruko, Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yagl di pre, yegl dugwa, Siragl eruko, ene kudugl geglme? Ene na yobuglna pre mediglkrimo? dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 4:41" />Jisas yegl dugo, ye duglo beglkwa yagl ye Jisas kuduglmo podo goglsre, yegl digwa, Aya, yagl irane? Ye ir ya nigl akie ka togo, pribriwe di, yegl digwa.<verse eid="MRK 4:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MRK 5" />
  <para style="s">Murubuglo kide tau yagl ta moglmara suna meglko, Jisas ye di meda edugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Matyu 8.28-34</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Luk 8.26-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 5:1" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="Demoniac" file="FM 159 Jesus Casts Out Demons_6inches_BW.jpg" size="col" copy="Foundation Matters" ref="5.1" />Ana Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yagl bogl nigl nubun Galili ede koglo pidre, Gerasa yoba meglmara eigwa. <verse eid="MRK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 5:2" />Eigo, Jisas baglkugl kide kodo ede meda ugwa igne, yagl ta gigl pene yomara pai mogl, ye moglmara ugwa. Yagl i murubuglo kide tau ye moglmara suna meglko, <verse eid="MRK 5:2" /><verse number="3-4" style="v" sid="MRK 5:3-4" />yoba geglkwa padiglmara pai wan moglkwa. Te, yoba ege tau mere ogo kagle sen mina si kane sigwa ba ye ege ege sen si biglke dugwa. Yegl eruko, yoba swara ta erme yobuglo ere, ye aglke kor kan wagle mo sen wagle si kane sinabuka kuno erekrukwa. <verse eid="MRK 5:3-4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 5:5" />Ye ege ege etne ya eduer yoba geglkwa yeimara ya muglo meglbi wan mogl, kaglkane yei, kobuglo idre, yene ogo nagie wagle bogl biglke dugwa.<verse eid="MRK 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 5:6" />Ana Jisas eglke iro mogl ugo, yagl i Jisas kandre, muku di ede pi Jisas umara yage kobragai pai, <verse eid="MRK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 5:7" />ka podo yegl dugwa, Jisas yo, ene God Mogl Mitna Kaima Ibo Edugwa Wam motnga i, ene siragl mere ere naragledi une? Na God kagie mina ene di prika i, ene giugl narekratnedi priwe dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 5:8" />Ye yegl dugwa i, siragl pre Jisas ye murubuglo kide i di tedre, Ene yagl i moglmara kide kodo, ede meda wio! di yegl di te kodugwa. <verse eid="MRK 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 5:9" />Ana Jisas ere mogl, Ene kagn dagl naro! dugo, yagl i, Kagna Ami we dugwa. I siragl pre no mere muniwe di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 5:10" />Te, murubuglo kide i, Jisas di pre, no di dumo bage eglke ta edekrabedi mogl, kamage yogwa.<verse eid="MRK 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 5:11" />Ana dumo i muglo meglbi ta yogo, muglo meglbi i mina bugla mere kide yumun ne meglkwa. <verse eid="MRK 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 5:12" />Ana Jisas ye murubuglo kide ede meda wio dugwa igne, murubuglo kide i Jisas di prisre, Ene no kanige etn, ede bugla meglmara suna enamniwe digo, <verse eid="MRK 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 5:13" />Jisas pra we dugwa. Pra we dugo, murubuglo kide i, yagl i moglmara kide kodo, ede meda udre, bugla mere kide meglmara suna eigo, bugla mudu i, guglo ta yomara muku di ede atne pi, nigl nubun suna pidre, nigl ne geglkwa. Bugla i, 2,000 mere yegl meglkwa.<verse eid="MRK 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14-15" style="v" sid="MRK 5:14-15" />Ana yoba ta ye bugla ikra sugl meglkwa i, ye taragl ta plau dugwa i kandre, muku di pi yoba taun suna kipaigwa ya meda kipaigwa i di teigo, yoba mudu pi taragl ta plau dugwa i kanamnedi ede eigwa. Ye pi Jisas moglmara plau didre, yagl ta murubuglo kide ye moglmara ede meda eigwa i, nomanemo u wakai ogo, ye kugugl gagl ede, ame di moglko, ye kandre, kudugl geglkwa. <verse eid="MRK 5:14-15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 5:16" />Kudugl gogl meglko, yoba tau ye siragl taragl bugla mina ya yagl murubuglo kide kau sugwa mina plau dugwa kanigwa i, ye boglo kugl teigwa. <verse eid="MRK 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 5:17" />Di teigo, prisre, Jisas ye dumono moglkre, ede bage ta enabedi kamage yeigwa.<verse eid="MRK 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 5:18" />Ana yoba i Jisas yegl di teigo, Jisas ede baglkugl kuglo pidre, ede enagledi eruko, yagl murubuglo kide okna ye moglmara suna meglkwa ikra, u Jisas bogl akie wanabugledi kamage yogwa. <verse eid="MRK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 5:19" />Yegl dugwa ba Jisas mane didre, yegl di togwa, Ene ede ikne pi yugun kaminen pidre, Yagl Kade ene siragl mere mitn goglsre, taragl podo ene ere togwa i, yobanma di to di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 5:20" />Yegl dugo, yagl i ede pi dumo ta taun 10-pela suna yogwa, kagie 10-pela Taun we dimara suna i pidre, Jisas ye siragl mere ake ple podo di tomere yoba mudu di togo, ye prisre, gagno keglkwa.<verse eid="MRK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abai gak ta goglko, Jisas ye ere i kor edidre, te, abu ta Jisas gaglmo akugo, kidemo aragan erukwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Matyu 9.18-26</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Luk 8.40-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 5:21" />Ana Jisas nigl nubun Galili mina aglke kor ede ikne koglo ya ugo, yoba mere kide Jisas nigle bina moglmara u makai si, winabo di meglkwa. <verse eid="MRK 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 5:22" />Ana Jisas ugo, yagl ta kagie Jairus we digwa i, ede Jisas moglmara udre, Jisas kagle mina yage kobragai paugwa. Yagl i ye Juda yoba ka mabuno yuguno ta sugl moglkwa yagle moglkwa. <verse eid="MRK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 5:23" />Ye Jisas kagle mina yage kobragai padre, kamage yei, yegl dugwa, Na abra kebra kide sugwa, goragledi erukwa. Ene u akin, ye aragan eran, goglkrabiwe di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 5:24" />Yegl dugo, Jisas ye bogl akie ede kipamara enabugledi ebrika.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 5:24">Ede ebriko, yoba mere kide ye omara, magigl magigl, gagie bai, eigwa. <verse eid="MRK 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 5:25" />Ana yoba eimara suna i, abu ta ogwa. Abu i kide ta sugo, abu ba kanimere yegl, bugla yugu 12-pela bu yeikruko, aimadi kan pai moglkwa. <verse eid="MRK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 5:26" />Te, dokta mere meglmara ogwa i, ye ake ple di tenaiglkwa i, manugo, ibun keme yugwa. Te abu i dokta topono te ogwa, migemo dudugwa ba kide ye sugwa i aragan erekre, u podo ogwa. <verse eid="MRK 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 5:27" />Ana abu i Jisas kamo digo, prukwa pre Jisas yoba mere kide bogl akie eimara i, abu i Jisas mokomugl u ye kuguglmo gaglmo akugwa. <verse eid="MRK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 5:28" />Akidre, prukwa i, Na ye kuguglmo gaglmo keme akibo, kidena bu yenabiwe di prukwa. <verse eid="MRK 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 5:29" />Ana ye gaglmo akugo, bormai ugwa i oglade bu yogo, yene ogo nagie wagle prukwa, kidena bu yomiwe di prukwa. <verse eid="MRK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 5:30" />Kidemo bu yogo, Jisas oglade Na yobra tau ede meda omedi prisre, yoba mere meglmara suna kan yake tedre, Ira na gaglna akume? di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 5:31" />Dugo, ye duglo beglkwa yagl i ere mogl, Ene siragl pre Ira na akume dine? digwa. Yoba mere bogl akie umga i, ene unara mogl winabo didre, nagn bai, ede wimiwe digwa. <verse eid="MRK 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 5:32" />Yegl digwa ba Jisas ye abu ta ye gaglmo akugwa i kanagledi kan koglo koglo edugwa. <verse eid="MRK 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 5:33" />Yegl eruko, abu i ye moglmara siragl plau dugwa i prisre, kudugl gogl, nagie nuglo didre, u Jisas moglmara yage kobragai padre, ye siragl mere erukwa i mudu Jisas di togwa. <verse eid="MRK 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 5:34" />Di togo, Jisas ye di te, yegl dugwa, Abra yo, ene na pre mediglnga pre kidenen bu yomiwa. Ene den mudun wida dinan, ede enatniwe dugwa.<verse eid="MRK 5:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 5:35" />Ana Jisas ka yegl di moglko, yoba tau ka mabuno yugu sugl moglkwa yagl ikra kipamara mogl, wigwa. Ye udre, yagl i yegl di togwa, Ene abutn goglmiwe digwa. Ene Tisa kogon tau tenatnga i, ta paikrume digwa. <verse eid="MRK 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 5:36" />Yegl digo, Jisas prisre, ka mabuno yugu sugl moglkwa yagle yegl di togwa, Ene kudugl goglkre, na yobuglna pre mediglo dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 5:37" />Yegl didre, ye yoba mudu akie enaiglkwa i mane didre, Pita, ya Jems ye agigle Jon i keme bogl akie Nono ede enamne dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 5:38" />Yegl dugo, ye ede pi ka mabuno yugu sugl moglkwa yagl i kipamara eigo, yoba mere kide kai ere, kai giglage sidre, taragl podo eriko, Jisas kanugwa.<figure style="fig" alt="Jairus daughter with mourners" file="lb00311b.tif" size="span" loc="5.38" copy="Louise Bass, British Foreign and Bible Society" ref="5.38" /> <verse eid="MRK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 5:39" />Kandre, ye ede yugugl pi yoba kai ere meglkwa yegl di togwa, Ene siragl eruko, kai ere, taragl podo ere meglme? dugwa. Abai kebra i ta goglkrukwa ba ugl keme pamiwe dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 5:40" />Yegl dugo, yoba ye gauglmo ere teigwa. Gauglmo ere teigwa ba ye yoba mudu i di meda edidre, abai goglkwa i nem mam yebriko, ye duglo beglkwa yagl suota i bogl, abai ikra kiule pai moglmara eigwa. <verse eid="MRK 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 5:41" />Eigo, Jisas ye abai i ogo akidre, Talita kum! dugwa. Ye ka dugwa i, mabuno yegl paugwa, Abai kebra, adiglo! <verse eid="MRK 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 5:42" />Ana Jisas yegl dugo, abai i oglade adigl, konbo u ikne ikne ogwa. Abai i, bugla yugu 12-pela nogwa. Ye adigl, konbo u ikne ikne ogo, ye nem mam si puglo di, gagno kiurika. <verse eid="MRK 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 5:43" />Yegl eribriko, Jisas ye yoba swara ta di te dinabredi mane kaima dugwa. Mane didre, ye kaya mokna ta nenaba, tero dugwa.<verse eid="MRK 5:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MRK 6" />
  <para style="s">Nasaret yoba Jisas mokono teigwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Matyu 13.53-58</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Luk 4.16-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 6:1" />Ana Jisas dumo i kide kodo, ye duglo beglkwa yagl bogl ede ye yugomugl dumo Nasaret i eigwa. <verse eid="MRK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 6:2" />Eigo, wakan kade yogo, Jisas ede ka mabuno yugu yomara yugugl pi yoba ka beke togwa. Ye ka beke te moglko, yoba mere kide prisre, nagino kogl, yegl digwa, Aiya, nomane podo yegl ya kimagl tau erukwa i, ira beke tedre, yobuglo togo, taragl mudu yegl erume? digwa. <verse eid="MRK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 6:3" />Ye yegl didre, kiam si, ama yegl digwa, Ye magigl i mogl, kapenta kogon eruko, kamgrawa. Te, ye mam Maria moglko, agiglema okuo Jems ya Josep, Judas ya Saimon meglko, te ye abaugloma nono bogl magigl i akie muniwe di, yegl digwa. Yegl didre, Jisas kubro teigwa. <verse eid="MRK 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 6:4" />Deno kubro teigo, Jisas di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, God kamo kep yoba ta morabuka i, yoba dumo pere pere moraiglkwa i, ye kamo praiglkwa ba yene yugomugl yoba ya neno agroma ya bormai swara meglkwa i, ye eran, kaima ta prikraiglmiwe dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 6:5" />Yegl didre, ye dumo i yoba kide sigwa suom ta ogo mina akidre, kideno ere wakai ere togwa ba ye kimagl tau ama erabuka i, kuno erekrukwa. <verse eid="MRK 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 6:6" />Kuno erekruko, ye Jisas pre mediglkrikwa i, kina podo yogwa.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="MRK 6:6">Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yagl 12-pela di bage bage edugwa</para>
  <para style="r" vid="MRK 6:6">(<ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Matyu 10.5-15</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Luk 9.1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:6">Ana Jisas dumo kade i kide kodidre, ede dumo kebra kebra pidre, yoba ka beke togwa. <verse eid="MRK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 6:7" />Ana Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yagl 12-pela agle dugo, wigo, ye murubuglo kide di meda edinaiglmedi yobuglo tedre, ye suo suode ede dumo pere pere enaiglmedi dedugwa. <verse eid="MRK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 6:8" />Dedidre, ye yegl di togwa, Ene konbauna wan enaiglmara i, muglbono keme idre, ede enaiglkwa. Ene bret ya gaglno kaban ta ikre, te ene mige gagl giurekre, yoko ede pio dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 6:9" />Te, ene kaglno towo edenaiglkwa ba gaglno suna suo edekrio. <verse eid="MRK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 6:10" />Te, ene dumo ta ede suna enaiglmara i, yoba ta ene di inabuka yugumo swara i pai mogl, okuo dumo i kide kodo ede dumo kor ta enaiglmiwa. <verse eid="MRK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 6:11" />Ana ene dumo swara ta ebi, yoba ene kano prikre, ta di ikribi, ene dumo i kide kodio. Te, ede enaiglkwa igne, ye aglauno nogugl panabedi pre kaglno kugane tama bagl edio di, Jisas yegl dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 6:12" />Yegl dugo, ye duglo beglkwa yagl suode ede bage bage pi, yoba ka mabuno di te, Nomane kor io! di, yegl di teigwa. <verse eid="MRK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 6:13" />Ka yegl di tedre, ye murubuglo kide mere di meda edidre, yoba kide sigwa i tau mere oliv nuglo wagle kugo ere tedre, ye kideno ere wakai ere teigwa.<verse eid="MRK 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Herot Jisas ye Jon moglmedi prukwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Matyu 14.1-12</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 3:19-20">Luk 3.19-20</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">9.7-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 6:14" />Ana igne i Jisas sigie kagie wanugo, King Herot prukwa. Jisas kagie wanugo, yoba tau ka yegl digwa, Yagl Jisas i, ye Jon nigl bugl togwa yagle goglkwa ikra, ye adigl u kor ogwa pre yobuglo paugo, kimagl yegl erimiwe di, yegl digwa. <verse eid="MRK 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 6:15" />Digo, tau Elaija ikra moglme digwa. Tau God ka kepmo yoba okna meglmere yegl ta moglme digwa. <verse eid="MRK 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 6:16" />Digwa ba Herot prukwa igne ye yegl dugwa, Aya, nana Jon nugu gariko, goglkwa ba erme ye adigl ede u kor pidre, ere moglmiwe dugwa.<verse eid="MRK 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17-18" style="v" sid="MRK 6:17-18" />Ana Herot ye okna Jon si goglkwa i, kamo yegl paugwa, Herot okna ye agigle Filip ebie na ebina morabedi yugwa. Ye agigle ebie i, kagie Herodias. Ye abu Herodias yugo, Jon ye ege mere di te, yegl dugwa, Ene agitn ebie inga i, aglau etniwe dugwa. Jon yegl dugwa pre Herot yoba dedugo, ye si kane si, i pi kane yugu edigwa. <verse eid="MRK 6:17-18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 6:19" />Te, abu Herodias, King Herot yugwa ikra we, Jon ye Herot ka togwa i ye ama prisre, Jon kide kan, si goragledi konbauna dokugwa. Konbauna dokugwa ba ye si gorabuka i, konbauna ta yekrukwa. <verse eid="MRK 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 6:20" />I siragl pre king Herot ye Jon si kane sugo, pai moglkwa ba Herot ye si gorabuka i, mane di prukwa. I siragl pre Jon mabuno wakai ersre, yagl du moglko, Herot kandre, ye si gorabuka i kudugl gogl, yoba ye si gogl dinabedi ye suglmo mogl, kugl bogl togwa. Kugl bogl tedre, Herot ye ege tau Jon agle dugo, Jon u Herot ka mabuno di togo, Herot prisre, wakai prukwa. Ye Jon ka mabuno dugwa prukwa i, pre pogl sikrukwa ba ye Jon ka dinan prabuka i, ama wakai pre pai moglkwa pre ege tau prukwa.<verse eid="MRK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 6:21" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="John the Baptist's head" file="C070 bw NT.tif" size="col" copy="Ethnos360" ref="6.21" />Ana okuo i we, Jon kane yugu pai moglko, abu Herodias ye Jon si gorabuka i, konbauna ta yogo, kanugwa. King Herot mam ye kuglkwa egemo yogo, ye yobamo kade ya te, ami sugl meglkwa yagl ya te, yagl kade distrik Galili suna meglkwa i kaya mokna podo gaglko, ye u neigwa. <verse eid="MRK 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 6:22" />U ne meglko, Herodias abuglo ede suna u, kagle egrukwa. Egruko, King Herot yoba kade bogl wakai kanigwa. Wakai kanigo, King abai i ka gigledi di padigl, yegl di togwa, Ene siragl ta kwian borabuka i, na di natn, ene tenaluwa. <verse eid="MRK 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 6:23" />Taragl kebra pre dinatno mo taragl kade na dumo sugl moglka i suna biglke di suo edidre, koglo ta ene naro dinatnga i, na ene tenaluwe di, ka gigledi yegl paduglkwa. <verse eid="MRK 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 6:24" />Yegl dugo, abai ikra ede meda pi ye mam di pre, Na siragl taragl naro dinagle? dugwa. Dugo, ye mam ere mogl, yegl dugwa, Ene di te, Jon, yoba ake nigl atne ede, nigl bugl togwa yagle ikra, nugu gare ede, ye bre yu naro di, yegl do! dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 6:25" />Yegl dugo, abai ikra tabre ede ikne king moglmara u yegl di togwa, Ene yagl Jon, yoba ake nigl atne ede, nigl bugl togwa yagle ikra, nugu tabre gare ede, ye bre plet mina yu naratnedi priwe dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 6:26" />Yegl dugo, king kide kaima prukwa ba ye ka giglede di te paduglkwa ikra pre ya te, ye di gaglkwa yoba kan meglkwa i pre mane dinabuka i, kuno erekrabedi prukwa. <verse eid="MRK 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 6:27" />Yegl prisre, ye oglade yagl ta Jon si gorabedi di te, Ye nugu gare ede, bre yuo dugwa. Dugo, yagl i ede kane yugu pi, Jon nugu gare ede, <verse eid="MRK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 6:28" />bre plet mina ede, yu abai i togo, abai i ere mogl, Jon bre i pi mam togwa.<verse eid="MRK 6:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 6:29" />Ana Herot ye Jon si goglko, Jon duglo beglkwa yagl digo, prisre, u ye ogo nagie idre, i pi kobuglo mur atne yeigwa.<verse eid="MRK 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas bret buko didre, yagl 5,000 togwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Matyu 14.13-21</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luk 9.10-17</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 6:1-13">Jon 6.1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 6:30" />Ana Jisas dedugwa yagl suode ede bage bage eigwa ikra, mudu ede ikne u Jisas moglmara makai sidre, ye kogon kane kane erikwa ya ka beke teimere mudu Jisas boglo kugl teigwa. <verse eid="MRK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 6:31" />Boglo kugl teigo, Jisas yegl di togwa, Nono erme ede pi yoba ta moglkrimara pidre, kuri ta mogl, ir si pramniwe dugwa. Ye siragl pre yegl dugwa i, yoba mere kide ye moglmara udre, ede eigo, kor meglkwa u suglo sigo, yegl erikwa pre Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yagl bogl kaya mokna nenaiglkwa i, ege ta yekrukwa. <verse eid="MRK 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 6:32" />Ana Jisas yegl dugo, ye duglo beglkwa yagl bogl yene moramnedi pre ede baglkugl mina kuglo pidre, ede dumo ta yoba moglkrimara eigwa.<verse eid="MRK 6:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 6:33" />Ede eigwa ba yoba tau mere ye ede eigo kandre, yuguno toglno yomara kide kodo, nigle bina muku di ede pi Jisas enabara komono kana pi plau digwa. <verse eid="MRK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 6:34" />Plau di, sugl meglko, Jisas baglkugl wagle ede meda pidre, ye yoba mere kide meglko, kandre, ye mitno kaima goglkwa. Ye kanugwa i, sipsip mere yegl meglko, sipsip suglno yoba ta moglkrimedi kanugwa. Yegl kandre, ka mabuno kane kane paugwa i, beke togwa. <verse eid="MRK 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 6:35" />Beke te moglko, min panagledi eruko, ye duglo beglkwa yagl i ede magigl pidre, yegl digwa, Dumo magigl i yugu togl ta yeikruko, min pai kodugwa <verse eid="MRK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 6:36" />pre ene yoba i dedin, ede enaiglmiwa. Ye magigl i, kidan gogl, kaya mokna ya yugu dokinaiglkwa pre dedin, ye ede taun ya yugu togl yomara enaiglmiwe digwa. <verse eid="MRK 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 6:37" />Yegl digo, Jisas di ikne ede yegl dugwa, Enene kaya mokna nenaiglmere teo dugwa. Dugo, ye di ikne ede, Yoba yegl mere meglkwa i, mige silva 200 mere ta i pi bret topo sumun, kuno erabedi pitno? di, yegl digwa. <verse eid="MRK 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 6:38" /><figure style="fig" alt="Feeding 5,000" file="cn01717B.tif" size="span" copy="David C Cook" ref="6.38" />Yegl digo, Jisas yegl di prukwa, Ene bret siramna yeigwa yomada? Pi kanio! dugwa. Yegl dugo, ye pi kandre, ede ikne u Jisas yegl di teigwa, Bret 5-pela yogo, buglo bagle suo ama yomiwe digwa.<verse eid="MRK 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 6:39" />Ana Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yagl di te, Ene yoba mudu di tebi, kugl wakai bogl moglmara ame dinaiglmiwe dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 6:40" />Dugo, ye bage bage ame di meglkwa. Bage tau yoba 50 mere ki yegl makai si meglko, bage tau 100 mere ki yegl makai si meglko, pere pere meglkwa. <verse eid="MRK 6:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 6:41" />Ame di meglko, Jisas ye bret 5-pela ya buglo bagle suo ikra idre, kan heven ibo ede, God di wakai yei togwa. Di wakai yei tedre, bret ake buko didre, ye duglo beglkwa yoba i pi tenaiglmedi togwa. Tedre, ye buglo bagle suo ikra ama ake buko didre, yoba mudu yubu si togwa. <verse eid="MRK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 6:42" />Yubu si togo, yoba mudu neigwa, dano eruko, <verse eid="MRK 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 6:43" />ye bret ya buglo bagle kawa te yogwa i, gade makai sidre, degigl gagl 12-pela gre kau sigwa. <verse eid="MRK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 6:44" />Ana Jisas yoba bret togwa neigwa i, mere kide meglkwa. Yagl 5,000 mere yegl meglkwa.<verse eid="MRK 6:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas nigl yaudomugl konbauna ogwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:22-23">Matyu 14.22-23</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 6:16-21">Jon 6.16-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 6:45" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="Jesus walking on water" file="FM 163 Jesus Walks on Water_6inches_BW.jpg" size="col" copy="Foundation Matters" ref="6.45" />Ana Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yagl di tedre, Tabre ede bakugl mina pio dugwa. Enene ede okna pi nigl koglo ibo, Betsaida we dimara ebi, na yoba mere magigl meglkwa i, di pere pere edinaluwe dugwa. Yegl dugo, ye ede eigwa. <verse eid="MRK 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 6:46" />Di pere pere edidre, ye swara ede muglo pi kamage eragledi ede ogwa.<verse eid="MRK 6:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 6:47" />Ana min paugo, Jisas yene mogl pai moglko, ye duglo beglkwa yagl ede koglo ibo enamnedi baglkugl wagle nigl suna ede eigwa. <verse eid="MRK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 6:48" />Ede suna pidre, yobuglo ere, nigl aware si, ede enamnedi erikwa, kuno erekrukwa. Ye enaiglmara ir podo u baglkugl guma ake ikne edugwa pre kuno erekrukwa. Ana Jisas ye yegl eriko, kandre, kamun tagenagledi eruko, ye nigl yaudomugl konbauna egre, ede eimara i pidre, ede okna enagledi erukwa. <verse eid="MRK 6:48" /><verse number="49-50" style="v" sid="MRK 6:49-50" />Ede okna enagledi erukwa ba ye duglo beglkwa yagl mudu kandre, kudugl podo gogl, grigle di, Yoba goglkwa ta kiamo umiwe digwa. Yegl digwa ba Jisas oglade yegl di togwa, Ene kiede mogl, kudugl goglkrio! Na wiwe dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 6:49-50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 6:51" />Yegl didre, ye ede baglkugl kuglo ogo, akie meglko, ir ugwa i, tabre bu yogwa. Bu yogo, ye duglo beglkwa yagl nagino podo keglkwa. <verse eid="MRK 6:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 6:52" />Ye nagino podo keglkwa i siragl pre Jisas okna bret idre, yagl 5,000 buko di togwa ikra, ye kanigwa ba nomano gigle dugwa pre Jisas ira ka kaima moglmedi nomane ta ikrikwa.<verse eid="MRK 6:52" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas dumo Genesaret we dimara mogl, yoba kide sigwa ere wakai ere togwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:34-36">Matyu 14.34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 6:53" />Ana Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yagl bogl ede nigl koglo ibo dumo Genesaret we dimara plau didre, ye baglkugl nigle bina kan kogl padigl, <verse eid="MRK 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 6:54" />ede meda eigwa. Eigo, yoba oglade Jisas ikra umedi kandre, <verse eid="MRK 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 6:55" />ye muku di ede koglo koglo pi di wai digo, yoba dumo magigl yeimara i prisre, yoba kide sigwa i ede padigl, boglo ere i pi Jisas aglo mere ta moglme digo primara i, eigwa. <verse eid="MRK 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 6:56" />Yegl erikwa i, Jisas ede aglo ogwa i, dumo kade mo kebra mo bina dage ta omara i, yoba makai sigwa dumo ta yomara i, yoba kide sigwa i pi igle edidre, kamage yei, yegl digwa, Ene kanige etn we, yoba kide sigwa i, ene gaglnen puduo akibi, kideno bu yenabiwe di, yegl di prikwa. Ye yegl di prisre, yoba ira ta Jisas kuguglmo gaglmo akigwa i, ye kideno aragan erukwa.<verse eid="MRK 6:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MRK 7" />
  <para style="s">Farisi yoba God kamo kide kodo, kowano awano mabunono erikwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:1-9">Matyu 15.1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 7:1" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="Ceremonial washing" file="LB00280b.tif" size="col" copy="Louise Bass, British Foreign and Bible Society" ref="7.1" />Ana igne i, Farisi yoba tau yeigo, God lomo beke teigwa yoba ama tau yeigo, dumo Jerusalem kide kodo, ede u Jisas moglmara mogl winabo didre, <verse eid="MRK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 7:2" />Jisas duglo beglkwa yagl tau kowano awano mabunono pamere erekre, ogono nigl koglkre, bret ake neigo, kanigwa. <verse eid="MRK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 7:3" />Farisi yoba ya te, Juda yoba pra pra ye kowano awano mabunono ake gi didre, ogono mabunono pamere nigl koglsre keme, kaya mokna neigwa. <verse eid="MRK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 7:4" />Ye maket wan mogl, ede ikne wigwa i, ama nigl padre keme, kaya mokna neigwa. Te, ye kowano awano mabunono pamere ama kap ya sin ya nigl migi nigl edigwa. Te, ye taragl ki yegl mere tau mere erikwa. <verse eid="MRK 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 7:5" />Ana Farisi yoba ya God lomo beke teigwa yagl ye yegl erekrikwa kandre, Jisas kira pogl pre yegl digwa, Siragl eruko, ene duglo beglkwa yagl meglkwa i, kowano awano mabuno pamere ogono nigl koglkre, kaya mokna ake neime? digwa. <verse eid="MRK 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 7:6" />Yegl digo, Jisas di ikne ede te, yegl dugwa, Ene ka didre, mabuno ta erikwa yoba meglkwa i, Aisaia ene pre God kamo ta kep ere, boglkwa i, kuno kaima erukwa. Ye ka ta ene pre boglkwa i, yegl paugwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 7:6">Yoba i ye drano wagle na kagna kade narikwa ba ye deno muduno eglke yomiwa. <verse eid="MRK 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 7:7" />Ye na kagna dagl, ake mina edigwa ba drano mina di yar edimiwa. Di yar edigwa i, i siragl pre ye yoba ka mabuno di tomne digwa i, kaima ta dikrisre, ye yoba lono i keme yoba di teimiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aisaia 29.13</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="MRK 7:7">di, Aisaia yegl boglkwa. <verse eid="MRK 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 7:8" />Kuno yegl, ene God lomo kide kodo, yoba mabunono ake gi dimiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="MRK 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 7:9" />Jisas ka yegl di kodidre, ama yegl dugwa, Ene kowano awano mabuno pamere eramnedi God lomo kaima pamara si biglke digwa i, win paugwa. <verse eid="MRK 7:9" /><verse number="10-13" style="v" sid="MRK 7:10-13" />Moses dugwa i, Ene neno mano kano prisre, pre i mitna edio<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.10-13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isip Kide Kodigwa 20.12, Lo 5.16</char></note> dugwa. Didre, ama yoba ta ye nem mo mam ka kide ta di tenan, ene ye si golo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.10-13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isip Kide Kodigwa 21.17, Tawa Teigwa 20.9</char></note> dugwa. God lomo yegl dugwa ba ene enene mabunono duglo boramnedi yoba ta ye nem mam pre i mitna edidre, taragl tau tenabuka pamara i, i eglke edidre, ye taragl i God tenaluwe dugwa i, ene kuno pamiwe digwa. Ye nem mam pre i mitna edidre, ake ple di tenabuka i, ene mane digwa mere yegl paugwa. Ene yegl dimara i, ene enene mabunono duglo boramnedi God lomo kide kodimiwe dugwa.<verse eid="MRK 7:10-13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Siragl taragl yoba si deglbi yenabuka i pre Jisas dugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:10-20">Matyu 15.10-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 7:14" />Ana Jisas aglke kor yoba mere magigl wio di, agle dugo, wigo, ye di te, yegl dugwa, Na ka ta erme dinaglka i, ene mudu prisre, nomane inaiglme dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 7:14" /><verse number="15-16" style="v" sid="MRK 7:15-16" />Taragl ta meda yogo, ne atne edigwa i, taragl i yoba ta si deglbi yeikrukwa ba taragl ta deno muduno mina yogo, ye drano mina ede meda ugwa i, taragl i kaima yoba si deglbi yomiwe dugwa.<verse eid="MRK 7:15-16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 7:17" />Ana Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yagl ikra bogl yoba mere kide meglkwa i kide kodidre, ede yugugl ta eigo, ye duglo beglkwa yagl Jisas ka ebrie dugwa ikra pre kira peglkwa. <verse eid="MRK 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 7:18" />Kira peglko, Jisas yegl dugwa, Ene ama nomane ikrimo? Taragl ta meda yogo, yoba ta ne atne edigwa i, taragl i yoba ta si deglbi yeikrukwa i, ene prikrikwa paugwa. <verse eid="MRK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 7:19" />Taragl ta meda yogo, yoba ne atne edigwa i, ede kiano mina pikrukwa ba ede deno biglko mina pidre, okuo ede de mur yugu omiwe dugwa. (Jisas ka yegl dugwa i, yoba kaya mokna kane kane nenaiglkwa i, mawagl ta paikrabuka pre dugwa.) <verse eid="MRK 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 7:20" />Ye ama yegl dugwa, Yoba deno muduno mina taragl ta pogglau boglko, nomano mina poglo di pre, mabuno erikwa ya ka digwa swara i, God gumuglo wagle yoba si deglbi yogwa. <verse eid="MRK 7:20" /><verse number="21-22" style="v" sid="MRK 7:21-22" />I siragl pre yoba nomane kide prikwa ya, kumugl abai mo yagl abu ta bogl kunogl neigwa ya, taragl kunogl neigwa ya, yoba si geglkwa ya, taragl bubuno geglkwa ya, mabuno kide kaima kane kane beglkwa ya, ka kibi digwa ya, taragl mane pamara nogugl erikwa ya, yoba kide pre teigwa ya, kenaglno sigwa ya, yene pre i mitna edigwa ya, nomane kide kane kane pamere erikwa i, yoba deno muduno mina padre, ede meda wigwa. <verse eid="MRK 7:21-22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 7:23" />Mabuno kide mudu i, yoba deno muduno mina yedre, ede meda ugo, ka kaima yoba si deglbi yeimiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="MRK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Fonisia abu ta Jisas pre meduglkwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:21-28">Matyu 15.21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 7:24" />Ana Jisas dumo i kide kodidre, ede pi dumo kebra ta ogwa. Dumo kebra i, taun Tair we dimara i magigl yogwa. Ye dumo i pidre, ede yugu ta yugugl ogwa. Pidre, ye yoba na magigl i umedi pre dinaiglmedi prukwa. Ye yegl prukwa ba ye teke ta panan, yoba pre kan erekraiglkwa mere yegl ta manga. Ye ugwa i, yoba prikwa. <verse eid="MRK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 7:25" />Yegl pre abu ta Jisas ume digo, prisre, oglade ye moglmara u kagle mina yage si, kobragai paugwa. Abu i, ye abuglo kebra moglmara murubuglo kide ta suna moglkwa. <verse eid="MRK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 7:26" />Te, abu i Juda abu ta moglkrukwa. Ye Fonisia abu ta mogl, ka Grik dugwa. Dumo Fonisia we digwa i, dumo kade ta Siria we dimara suna yogwa. Ana ye Jisas moglmara u yage kobragai padre, ye abuglo moglmara murubuglo kide ta suna moglkwa ikra Jisas ye di meda edenabedi kamage yei, di pre moglkwa. <verse eid="MRK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 7:27" />Di pre moglko, Jisas di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Yoba ta gak kebra kaya mokna nenaiglmere tenaiglkwa i, ake towa si idre, agl ta tebi, wakai ta paikrabuka. Gak kebra komono kana nenaiglmiwe dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 7:28" />Yegl dugwa ba abu i di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Yagl Kade yo, ene kuno ere dinga ba agl kiglkwa yoba ta kaya mokna plet mina nebi, kebra yage maginagle sinabuka i, agl bogl atne moraiglkwa i nenaiglmiwe dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 7:29" />Yegl dugo, Jisas di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Ene ka di ikne edinga i, wakai dinga pre ene ede ikne yugunmugl po. Murubuglo kide ikra ene abutn moglmara kide kodo, ede meda omiwe di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 7:30" />Yegl dugo, abu ikra ede ikne yugomugl pi kanugwa, murubuglo kide ye abuglo moglmara ede meda ogo, ye bogl mina ugl pai moglko, kanugwa.<verse eid="MRK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yagl ta kina gi dugo, ama ka di kun erekrukwa ta Jisas ere wakai ere togwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 7:31" />Ana Jisas dumo kebra ta Tair yomara magigl moglkwa ikra kide kodo, ye ede pi taun Saidon pidre, aglke kor ede pi nigl nubun Galili we dimara i pidre, i kide kodo, aglke kor ede pi distrik ta 10-pela Taun we dimara i ogwa. <verse eid="MRK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 7:32" />Ogo, yoba ere mogl, yagl ta kina gi dugo, ka di kun erekrukwa ta auro yu Jisas moglmara edidre, Jisas ye ogo i pi yagl i akidre, ere wakai ere tenabedi kamage yeigwa. <verse eid="MRK 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 7:33" />Kamage yeigo, Jisas yagl i agre idre, yoba mere kide meglmara i kide kodo, ede bina ta pi mogl, ye ogo mogo suo i pi yagl i kina kun mina koglo koglo edidre, eur si ogo mogo mina padigl, i pi yagl i drabie mina si baugwa. <verse eid="MRK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 7:34" />Drabie mina si badre, ye kan heven ibo ede, muru i meda edidre, yagl i di te, Efata! dugwa. Ye ka Efata dugwa i, Yauro edo! mere yegl dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 7:35" />Yegl dugo, yagl i kina gi dugo, ka di kun erekrukwa ikra, erme ka pre, ka kuno di, erukwa. <verse eid="MRK 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 7:36" />Yegl eruko, Jisas yoba mudu magigl meglkwa i di te, Yoba ta di tekrio! dugwa. Yegl dugwa ba ye yoba di te wan meglkwa. Jisas ye yoba ege mere Di tekrio! dugwa, ba ye dugwa i prikre, ye yoba di te keme erikwa. <verse eid="MRK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 7:37" />I siragl pre ye Jisas erukwa i kandre, nagino podo kogl, yegl digwa, Jisas ye taragl mudu wakai keme erume digwa. Ye yoba kinano gi digwa i, ka praiglmedi ersre, yoba ka dikrikwa i, ka dinaiglmedi erumiwe di, yegl digwa.<verse eid="MRK 7:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MRK 8" />
  <para style="s">Jisas bret buko didre, yoba 4,000 togwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:32-39">Matyu 15.32-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 8:1" />Ana igne i yoba mere kide kaima aglke kor dagl u Jisas moglmara makai sigwa. Makai si mogl pai meglkwa pre ye kaya mokna nenaiglkwa ta yekruko, Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yagl agle dugo, wigo, ye yegl di togwa, <verse eid="MRK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 8:2" />Yoba mere kide wigwa i, na mitno goglka. Nono ege suota munara magigl i, ye kaya moknano dudugwa. <verse eid="MRK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 8:3" />Te, tau dumo eglke mogl wigwa pre yoko ede pio dibo, kaima pi konbauna bage gumuglno magran, yage sinaiglkwa mere yegl pamiwe dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 8:4" />Yegl dugo, ye duglo beglkwa yagl di ikne ede, yegl digwa, Nono magigl i, wau yomara, kugl bage munga. Yegl pre bret aglo doko i tomun, yoba ye ne kuno eraiglme? digwa. <verse eid="MRK 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 8:5" />Yegl digo, Jisas ye di pre, Ene bret siramna yeigwa, yome? dugwa. Yegl dugo, ye No bret 7-pela yomga, yoko yomiwe digwa.<verse eid="MRK 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 8:6" />Ana Jisas ere mogl, yoba mudu ame dio dugo, ame di meglko, ye bret 7-pela idre, God di wakai yei tedre, ake buko di, ye duglo beglkwa yagl togwa. Togo, ye i pi yoba mudu ame di meglkwa i, teigwa. <verse eid="MRK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 8:7" />Ana ye buglo bagle kebra suom ta ama yeigwa pre Jisas buglo bagle i ama idre, God di wakai yei tedre, ye duglo beglkwa yagl tedre, Ene i pi yubu si teo dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 8:8" />Ye yubu si teigo, yoba mudu neigo, dano erukwa. Dano eruko, tau yoko yogwa i, ye i makai sidre, degigl gagl kade 7-pela gre kau sigwa. <verse eid="MRK 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 8:9" />Ana yoba igle meglko, Jisas bret togwa i, 4,000 mere yegl meglkwa. Ana ye ne kodigo, Jisas ye di pere pere edugo, ye ede eigwa. <verse eid="MRK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 8:10" />Ye ede eigo, Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yagl bogl oglade ede baglkugl mina pi mogl, ye ede pi distrik ta Dalmanuta we dimara pi plau digwa.<verse eid="MRK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yoba tau Jisas kimagl eran, kanamnedi prikwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:1-4">Matyu 16.1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 8:11" />Plau digo, Farisi yoba ye moglmara udre, Jisas aglau eran, kanamnedi yegl digwa, Ene God yobuglomo idre, kimagl ta etn, pre medramniwe digwa. <verse eid="MRK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 8:12" />Yegl digo, Jisas dem muduo wagle kide prisre, muru i meda ede, yegl dugwa, Ene yugobuno erme meglkwa i, siragl pre na kimagl diu ta eran, kanamnedi prime? Na ene ka kaima di teiga, na kimagl diu ta eribo, ene ta kankraiglmiwe dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 8:13" />Yegl didre, ye kide kodo, aglke kor ede baglkugl wagle pi, ede nigl koglo ibo ogwa.<verse eid="MRK 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas ere mogl, Farisi yoba yisno ya Herot yismo pre ka ebrie dugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:5-12">Matyu 16.5-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 8:14" />Ana Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yagl bogl ede nigl koglo ibo eigo, duglo beglkwa yagl bret tau nenaiglkwa i kiure, wigwa paugwa. Te, bret ta nenaiglkwa i, swara keme baglkugl mina yogo, kanigwa. <verse eid="MRK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 8:15" />Yegl kanigo, Jisas ye ka giglede di te, yegl dugwa, Farisi yoba ya King Herot yisno i pre ene kan kun erio! dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 8:16" />Yegl dugo, ye duglo beglkwa yagl wagle prikwa i, No bret ikrumga i pre dumedi drano digwa. <verse eid="MRK 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 8:17" />Ye yegl digo, Jisas pre kan ere, yegl dugwa, Siragl pre ene bret yukrikwa i pre ka drano dime? Na erika i, ene kan pogl sikriko, nomano gigle kaima dumo? <verse eid="MRK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 8:18" />Ene gumuglno koglo koglo paugwa ba ene kan pogl sikriko, kinano ama koglo koglo paugwa ba ene ka prikrikwa paugwa. Na okna erika i, ene pre meglmo mo pre moglkrime? <verse eid="MRK 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 8:19" />Na bret 5-pela ake buko didre, yoba 5,000 teigo, bret yoko yomara i mina ene degigl gagl siramna gre kau sime? dugwa. Dugo, ye di ikne ede, Degigl gagl 12-pela gre kau sumne digwa. <verse eid="MRK 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 8:20" />Yegl digo, ye aglke kor di te, Ama yoba 4,000 kuno yegl mere ersre, bret 7-pela mina teigo, kawa togwa degigl gagl kade siramna girime? dugo, ye 7-pela gre kau sumne digwa. <verse eid="MRK 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 8:21" />Yegl digo, Jisas ye di te, Ene na ira moglka i, pre pogl sikrimiwe dugwa.<verse eid="MRK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas dumo Betsaida mogl, yagl ta gumuglo koglo koglo kin yogwa i, ere wakai erukwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 8:22" />Ana Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yagl bogl ede pi dumo Betsaida we dimara eigo, yoba tau ere mogl, yagl ta gumuglo koglo koglo kin yogwa agre i Jisas moglmara ede, Jisas ye akidre, ere wakai ere tenabedi kamage yei, di prikwa. <verse eid="MRK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 8:23" />Di priko, Jisas yagl i ogo ake, agre i ede pi yoba dumo kebra kipai meglmara bina ta pidre, ye eur si yagl i gumuglo wagle edidre, ogo koglo koglo i pi yagl i gumuglo mina akugwa. Akidre, ye yagl i di pre, yegl dugwa, Ene erme taragl ta kano mo kankitne? dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 8:24" />Dugo, yagl i kan ple di kandre, yegl dugwa, Na yoba kaniga ba kan pogl sikrika. Ye ede mere yegl ta adigl pai, u ikne ikne pi wan meglmedi kanie di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 8:25" />Yegl dugo, Jisas aglke kor ogo koglo koglo ye gumuglo mina akugo, ye pene di kanagledi erukwa. Eruko, ye gumuglo aglke kor u wakai ogo, ye kan kuno erukwa. <verse eid="MRK 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 8:26" />Yegl eruko, Jisas yagl i di tedre, yegl dugwa, Ene erme ede ikne dumo magigl i suna pikre, ede yugun kaminen po! dugwa.<verse eid="MRK 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Na ira moglmedi prime?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 8:27" />Ana Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yagl bogl ede pi yugu togl tau taun bina bina Sisaria Filipai we dimara enamnedi eigo, konbo bage ye duglo beglkwa yagl di pre, yegl dugwa, Ene pribi, yoba na ira moglme dime? dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 8:28" />Yegl dugo, ye di ikne ede yegl digwa, Ene Jon nigl bugl togwa yagle ikra, adigl u kor enga, motniwe digwa. Te, tau digwa i, ene Elaija motniwe digwa. Te, tau digwa i, ka kep yoba okna ibo meglkwa i, swarano ta u kor enga, motniwe di, yegl dime digwa. <verse eid="MRK 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 8:29" />Yegl di kodigo, Jisas yegl dugwa, Ana ene we? Ene na ira moglme di prime? dugwa. Yegl dugo, Pita di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Ene God Kere Yugwa Yagl motniwe dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 8:30" />Ana Jisas ye ka gigledi di tedre, Na ira moglka i, yoba ta di tekrio dugwa.<verse eid="MRK 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas goglsre, adigl u kor enabuka pre dugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:21-28">Matyu 16.21-28</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 9:22-27">Luk 9.22-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 8:31" />Ana ege i mina Jisas mabuno bogl ka di nogugl ede tedre, yegl dugwa, Na Yoba Wam moglka i, yubun podo tau inaglka paugwa. Israel yobano kade meglkwa i, ya te tawa teigwa yoba bitno meglkwa i, ya te God lomo beke teigwa yoba i, mudu mokono narsre, na si geglbi, na ege suota mogl, adigl u kor enaglka pamiwe di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 8:32" />Ye ka yegl dugwa i, nogugl kaima dugwa. Dugo, Pita prisre, Jisas auro i bina edidre, ka togwa. <verse eid="MRK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 8:33" />Ka togo, Jisas aglke kan ikne ye duglo beglkwa yagl tau meglmara i edidre, Pita ka te, yegl dugwa, Satan, na moglmara ede eglke po! dugwa. Ene ka dinga i, yoba nomano pamere i keme dinga ba God nomanemo pamere i ene ta dikitniwe dugwa.<verse eid="MRK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 8:34" />Ana Jisas ka yegl di kodidre, ye duglo beglkwa yagl ya yoba mudu agle dugo, wigo, ye yegl di togwa. Yoba ta na duglo boragledi prabuka i, yoba ede prak kake ede eigo, si geglmere mere yegl, ye gorabuka i pre gun yedre, te ye yene nomanemo si goglsre, na duglo borabuka paugwa. <verse eid="MRK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 8:35" />I siragl pre yoba ta na pre gorabuka i pra we didre, te, na kana yoba di tenabuka pre gorabuka i pra we dinan, ye kor kaima morabuka. Ba yoba erme keme kor mogl, wakai moragledi pran, ye u kide enabuka.<verse eid="MRK 8:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 8:36" />Yoba ta makandigle taragl mudu nem yagl morabuka ba ye yene u kide pidre, wau boran, wakai panabo? <verse eid="MRK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 8:37" />Mo, yoba kia mina kor morabuka i pre siragl wakai ta tedre, ikrabiwe dugwa.<verse eid="MRK 8:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 8:38" />Ene yugobuno erme meglkwa i, ene u kide pi kodidre, abu ta wie kide kodo yagl ta bogl kunogl nebrere mere yegl meglkwa. Ene meglmara suna i ta na Yoba Wam moglka i, againa goglsre, na kana pre ama agai goran, okuo yobamo i ama agaimo goraglka. Na Nina kagie kade pamere yegl na kagna kade naran, na Nina angeloma bogl akie unamga igne i, na yoba i againo goraglka pre diwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="MRK 8:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MRK 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 9:1" />Jisas yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Na ene kaima di teiga, ene yoba tau magigl adigl meglkwa i, goglkre, yoko meglbi, God yobuglo eran, ye yoba kingno mogl, ye suglno morabuka ege i, plau dinan, kanaiglmiwe dugwa.<verse eid="MRK 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas ogo nagie u pere ta ogwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:1-13">Matyu 17.1-13</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Luk 9.28-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 9:2" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="Transfiguration" file="CN01728B.TIF" size="col" copy="David C Cook" ref="9.2" />Ana Jisas ka yegl di kodugo, ege 6-pela de ede ogo, ye Pita ya Jems ya Jon keme auro idre, ede muglo ibo ta ogwa. Muglo ibo ogo, ye ogo nagie u pere ta ogo, <verse eid="MRK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 9:3" />ye kuguglmo gaglmo pe kaima sidre, pogl dugwa. Pe kaima sugwa i, makandigle yoba kuguglno gaglno nigl edidre, blits wagle ere i kruo edibi, pe sinabere mere yegl sikre, Jisas gaglmo i pe kide kaima sugwa. <verse eid="MRK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 9:4" />Yegl mere eruko, yagl suo ta ye moglmara plau dibriko, Jisas bogl ka di meglkwa. Yagl suo i, Moses ya Elaija miurka. <verse eid="MRK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 9:5" />Ka di meglko, Pita ere mogl yegl dugwa, Neno Yagle , no magigl munga i, wakai pamiwa. No yugu teka suota tabre sumun, swara ta ene pre yenan, swara ta Moses pre yenan, swara ta Elaija pre yenabiwe dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 9:6" />Pita ka yegl dugwa i, ye Jems ya Jon bogl kudugl podo geglkwa pre ka di yar edugwa. <verse eid="MRK 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 9:7" />Dugo, kamun kua ta winabo di, si bi dugo, kamun kua i mina ka ta ede meda ugwa i, yegl dugwa, Yoba i na Wana moglmiwa. Ye na dena muduna suna moglkwa. Ye kamo prio! dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 9:8" />Ana ka i udre, dudugo, kanigwa i, Jisas yene adigl moglko, kanigwa.<verse eid="MRK 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 9:9" />Ana ye Jisas bogl muglo ibo kide kodo, ede atne u meglko, Jisas ye ka gigledi di te, Erme taragl ta kanigwa i, yoba swara ta di tekrio. Na Yoba Wam moglka i, goglsre, adigl u kor ebo, okuo yoba di tenaiglmiwe dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 9:10" />Yegl dugo, ye dumere ere, yoba swara ta di tekrikwa ba yagl suota i yene meglmara suna ye ka di ikne ikne ede pre, yegl digwa, Ye Na goglsre, adigl u kor enagle dugwa i, siragl pre dume? digwa. <verse eid="MRK 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 9:11" />Yegl didre, ye Jisas yegl di prikwa, God lomo beke teigwa yoba digwa i, Elaija komono kana unan, Yoba Wam okuo unabe digwa i, siragl pre dimedi pitne? digwa. <verse eid="MRK 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 9:12" />Yegl digo, Jisas ye di ikne ede yegl dugwa, Elaija unabe digwa i, kaima udre, taragl kane kane ake kun erabuka paugwa pre kuno digwa. Ba siragl pre God kamo wagle Yoba Wam yubun mere kide inan, yoba ye mokono tenaiglme dume? <verse eid="MRK 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 9:13" />Na ene di teiwa, Elaija kaima ede ikne u kodugwa ba yoba yene primere mabuno kide ere teigwa. God kamo yoba ye ere tenaiglme dumere erimiwe di, yegl dugwa.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jisas ye Elaija ede ikne ume dugwa i, ye ka yake tedre, Jon pre dugwa. Jon ye u, Elaija okna kogon erumere eruko, yoba ye si geglkwa i pre dugwa.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Murubuglo kide yagl gak ta moglmara suna moglkwa i, Jisas di meda edugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:14-21">Matyu 17.14-21</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43">Luk 9.37-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 9:14" />Ana Jisas ye Pita, Jems ya, Jon bogl akie ede ikne Jisas duglo beglkwa yagl tau meglmara wigwa igne, ye kanigwa i, yoba mere kide ye meglmara i meglko, God lomo beke teigwa yagl tau ama suna mogl, Jisas duglo beglkwa yoba bogl ka drano di meglkwa kanigwa. <verse eid="MRK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 9:15" />Ba yoba mere kide magigl meglkwa i, mudu Jisas umedi kandre, gagno kogl, ye oglade kogl kare di ere inamnedi muku di ede pi ye umara eigwa. <verse eid="MRK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 9:16" />Yegl eriko, Jisas ye di pre, Ene siragl pre ka drano di meglme? dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 9:17" />Yegl dugo, yoba mere wimara suna i, yagl ta ka podo didre, yegl dugwa, Tisa yo, na wana agre yu, ene motnara wiwe dugwa. Murubuglo kide ta ye moglmara suna mogl, ye ka dikrabedi erukwa. <verse eid="MRK 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 9:18" />Murubuglo kide ye moglmara suna ogwa igne, ye pia si makandigle edugo, ye dra eurie sidre, sigie gikr eruko, ogo kagle diglke di pai moglmiwe dugwa. Yegl erukwa pre na ene duglo beglkwa yagl murubuglo kide i di meda edinaiglmedi di prika ba ye di meda edinamnedi erikwa, manumiwe di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 9:19" />Ana yagl i yegl dugo, Jisas di ikne ede yegl dugwa, Ene yoba yugobuno erme meglkwa i, na pre mediglkrikwa. Nono akie ege olto munga i, na pre medraiglmo mo pre mediglkraiglme? Ene wan pra auro yu magigl ya edo! dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 9:20" />Yegl dugo, ye gak ikra agre ede Jisas moglmara wigo, murubuglo kide i Jisas kandre, ye oglade gak i ogo gagie ake pru dinabedi eruko, gak yage makandigle sidre, bera kara u ikne ikne ogo, dra eurie sugwa.<verse eid="MRK 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 9:21" />Ana gak i yegl eruko, Jisas ere mogl, gak nem di pre, yegl dugwa, Murubuglo kide i ege siramna ye moglmara suna moglme? di, yegl dugwa. Yegl dugo, gak nem ye di te, yegl dugwa, Ye gak kebra mogl, ede u erme ugwa i, murubuglo kide ye moglmara suna moglme dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 9:22" />Murubuglo kide i, ege mere na wana si goragledi ere, pia si doga mina ya nigl mina edumiwe dugwa. Yegl erukwa ba ene taragl ta eratnga kuno ta eran, no mitno gogl, no ake ple di noro! di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 9:23" />Yegl dugo, Jisas di ikne ede te, yegl dugwa, Ene taragl ta eratnga kuno eran we di yegl dinga i we? dugwa. Ene na pre medigln, na taragl mudu eraglka keme pamiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 9:24" />Jisas yegl dugo, gak nem ikra oglade ka podo didre, yegl di togwa, Na ene pre mediglka ba na kinana suo yenabara i ene na kinana suo yekrabedi ero! di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 9:25" />Yegl dugo, yoba mere kide ye dibrika i kanamnedi tabre u ye miurara i wigwa. Wigo, Jisas kandre, ye murubuglo kide ka te, yegl dugwa, Ene murubuglo kide, gak i kina gi dinabedi ere, ye ka dikrabedi ere motnga i, ene ye moglmara kide kodo, ede meda pidre, aglke kor ye moglmara ikne ukro! di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 9:26" />Yegl dugo, murubuglo kide ikra kaglkane idre, gak i moglmara ogo gagie ake piga podo kaima didre, ede meda ogwa. Ede meda ogo, gak i yoba ta goglkwa mere yegl pai mogl, wermane erekrukwa pre yoba ikra kandre, Gak i goglmiwe di, yegl digwa. <verse eid="MRK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 9:27" />Yegl digwa ba Jisas gak i ogo ake aduglko, ye aduglkwa.<verse eid="MRK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 9:28" />Ana okuo Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yagl bogl ede pi yugugl ta yene mudu meglko, ye Jisas di pre, yegl digwa, Siragl eruko, no murubuglo kide di meda edinamnedi erumga kuno erekrume? digwa. <verse eid="MRK 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 9:29" />Yegl digo, Jisas di ikne ede te, yegl dugwa, Murubuglo kide yegl meglkwa i, ene di meda edinamnedi eraiglkwa i, ene God kamage ere tebi keme ye ede meda enaiglmiwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="MRK 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas gorabuka pre aglke kor dugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Matyu 17.22-23</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 9:43-45">Luk 9.43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30-31" style="v" sid="MRK 9:30-31" />Ana Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yagl bogl dumo meglmara i kide kodo, ye ede distrik Galili we dimara i pidre, suna i konbauna wan ede eigwa. Konbauna wan eigwa ba Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yagl keme ka beke tenagledi prukwa pre ye eimara i yoba pre kan erekraiglmedi prukwa. Prisre, ye duglo beglkwa yagl ka beke te, yegl dugwa, Na Yoba Wam moglka i, yoba ta na i pi yoba pere ogono mina yenabuka paugwa. Ogono mina yenan, yoba i na si geglbi, na ege suota mogl, adigl u kor enaglka pamiwe dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 9:30-31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 9:32" />Yegl dugwa ba ye duglo beglkwa yagl mem pre pogl sikrikwa te, ye ka i pre Jisas di praiglkwa i, kudugl geglkwa pre dikrikwa.<verse eid="MRK 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas duglo beglkwa yagl i, ira kra mogl mitna edibedi pre ka drano digwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Matyu 18.1-5</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Luk 9.46-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 9:33" />Ye konbauna wan ede dumo Kapernaum pi plau didre, ede yugu ikra eigwa. Ede yugugl eigo, Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yagl di pre, yegl dugwa, Nono konbauna u mungo, ene konbo bage ka drano digwa i, siragl pre dime? dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 9:34" />Dugo, ye duglo beglkwa yagl i ye ka okna dimara pre agai gogl, ka ta di ikne edekrikwa. I siragl pre ye konbauna u meglkwa igne, ye yene meglmara suna i, ira mogl mitna ede, tau egre tenabuka i pre ka drano digwa. <verse eid="MRK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 9:35" />Ana Jisas ame didre, ye duglo beglkwa yagl magigl ya wio di togo, wigo, Jisas ye di te, yegl dugwa, Ene ta kade moragledi pratnga i, ene mogl atne edidre, yoba ake ple di tenatnga pamiwe dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 9:36" />Yegl didre, ye gak kebra ta agre i ede u ye meglmara suna edidre, gak kebra i kugro moglsre, ye duglo beglkwa yagl yegl di togwa, <verse eid="MRK 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 9:37" />Yoba ta na pre mediglsre, gak kebra yegl mere ta di inan, ye na di yugwa. Te, na di inabuka i, na swara keme di yukrukwa ba na Nina na dedugo, wiga i, ye ama di yumiwe dugwa.<verse eid="MRK 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yoba ta nono ere kide ere norokrabuka i, ye nono mina moglme dugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 9:49-50">Luk 9.49-50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 9:38" />Ana Jisas ka yegl di kodugo, Jon di yegl dugwa, Tisa yo, no kamga, yagl ta ene kagn daglsre, murubuglo kide di meda edenagledi eruko, kamniwa. Kandre, ye no duglo bunga yoba munara suna ta moglkrukwa pre ye mane di tomne dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 9:39" />Jon yegl dugwa ba Jisas di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Ene ye mane di tekrio! Yoba ta na kagna daglsre, kimagl ta eran, yoba i aglke tabre ere mogl, na kenaglna ta sikrabuka. <verse eid="MRK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 9:40" />Yoba ta ere mogl, nono ere kide ere norokran, ye nono mina moglkwa. <verse eid="MRK 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 9:41" />Na ene ka kaima di teiga, yoba ta ere mogl, ene na God Kere Yugwa Yagle moglka i yobanama meglmedi pre nigl kor kap swara ta kogl tenan, ye topomo ta wau boglkrabiwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="MRK 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yoba yage si dinamedi eraiglkwa paugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:6-9">Matyu 18.6-9</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 17:1-2">Luk 17.1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 9:42" />Ba gak kebra magigl meglkwa i, na pre mediglkwa pre yoba ta yage sinabedi eran, ye yubun podo kide inabuka. Yoba ta ye nugu mina kobuglo podo ta kan kogl padigl, pia si mudi nigl atne edibi, yuwaglke panabuka ba God ye ka tage tenabuka i, podo kide panabuka. <verse eid="MRK 9:42" /><verse number="43-44" style="v" sid="MRK 9:43-44" />Te, ene ogono ta ene yage sinaiglmedi eran, ogono i si keglu sio! Ene ogono koglo ekrike panan, ene ede pi kor moraiglmara enaiglkwa i, wakai panabuka. Ba ene ogono suo akie panan, ene ede doga kade aimadi de pamara enaiglkwa i, kide panabiwe dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 9:43-44" /><verse number="45-46" style="v" sid="MRK 9:45-46" />Te, ene kaglno ta ene yage sinaiglmedi eran, kaglno i si keglu sio! Ene kaglno koglo ekrike panan, ene ede kor moraiglmara enaiglkwa i, wakai panabuka. Ba ene kaglno suo akie panan, ene ede doga kade de pamara ebi, i kide panabuka. <verse eid="MRK 9:45-46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 9:47" />Te, ene gumuglno ta ene yage sinaiglmedi eran, gumuglno pogl edio! Aglau eran, ene gumuglno kogl koglo panan, ede doga kade enatnga i, kide panabuka. Ba ene gumuglno koglo ekrike keme panan, ene God yoba kingno mogl, ye sugl morabara enaiglkwa i, wakai panabuka. <verse eid="MRK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 9:48" />Doga kade de pamara i, degreme yoba ogono nagino aimadi kamin ne mogl, dudukrikwa ya te, doga aimadi kamin de panan, gogokrabuka.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.48 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aisaia 66.24</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 9:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 9:49" />Yoba kaya mokna mina mudi sigwa, ake beimere mere yegl, God doga dedenan, yoba mudu de, gagno mina ake benabiwe dugwa.<verse eid="MRK 9:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 9:50" />Mudi taragl wakai ta yogwa ba mudi kuglomo ta dudinan, ene siragl mere kuglomo ere ikne edinaiglme? Ene mudi mere yegl moglsre, deno muduno swara yei, wakai akie molo.<verse eid="MRK 9:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MRK 10" />
  <para style="s">Jisas yagl abu si biglke digwa pre dugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:1-12">Matyu 19.1-12</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luk 16.18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 10:1" />Ana Jisas dumo ta moglmara i kide kodo, ede distrik Judia nigl Jordan koglo ibo kra ogwa. Ye dumo i ogo, yoba mere kide aglke kor ye moglmara wigwa. Wigo, ye ege ege yoba ka beke tomere yegl ye ama ka beke togwa.<verse eid="MRK 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 10:2" />Beke te moglko, Farisi yoba tau ye moglmara udre, Jisas ka aglau ere dinabo mo di, kira yegl pogl prikwa, Yagl ta ye ebie sedinabuka i, mane ta pamo mo paikrume? digwa. <verse eid="MRK 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 10:3" />Yegl digo, Jisas di ikne ede yegl dugwa, Okna ibo, Moses ene kowano awano siragl mere eraiglmedi di tome? dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 10:4" />Dugo, Farisi yoba yegl digwa, Yagl ta ebie sedinagledi pran, ye pepa ta bogl tedre, sedinabuka i, Moses pra we dumiwe digwa. <verse eid="MRK 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 10:5" />Digo, Jisas di ikne ede, Owo. Ene God kamo prakirikwa yoba meglkwa pre Moses ene yegl eraiglmedi pra we dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 10:6" />Ba okna ibo God taragl pra pra ere yogwa igne, ye yagl ya abu beke yogwa.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Oknayane Ibo 1.27</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 10:7" />Te, mabuno i pre yagl ye nem mam kide kodidre, <verse eid="MRK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 10:8" />ye ebie bogl si dakagl morabrika. Miur, ye pere pere moglkribrika. Ogno nagino swara kaima mere yegl paugwa. <verse eid="MRK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 10:9" />Yegl paugwa pre God taragl ta ere i swara edenabuka i, yoba ta ere i pere pere edekraiglmiwe dugwa.<verse eid="MRK 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 10:10" />Ana okuo Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yagl bogl ede yugugl ta eigo, ye duglo beglkwa yagl Jisas ka dugwa i, kira pogl prikwa. <verse eid="MRK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 10:11" />Kira pogl priko, ye yegl di togwa, Yagl ta ye ebie sedidre, abu kor ta yunan, ye abu i kunogl nogwa. <verse eid="MRK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 10:12" />Te, abu ta wie kide kodo, ede yagl kor ta enan, ye yagl i kunogl nomiwe dugwa.<verse eid="MRK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas Gak kebra na moglmara unaiglkwa i, kanige erio dugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Matyu 19.13-15</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Luk 18.15-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 10:13" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="Children" file="CN01771B.TIF" size="col" copy="David C Cook" ref="10.13" />Ana yoba tau gak kebra Jisas akenabedi auro yuigwa. Auro yuigo, Jisas duglo beglkwa yagl kandre, ka teigwa. <verse eid="MRK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 10:14" />Ka teigo, Jisas kandre, ye dem boglko, ye yegl di togwa, Gak kebra na moglmara unaiglkwa i, ene mane dikre, kanige erio! I siragl pre yoba ta gak meglmere yegl ta moraiglkwa i, God yoba kingno mogl, ye suglno morabara yoba i pre yenabuka. <verse eid="MRK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 10:15" />Na ene ka kaima di teiga. Yoba ta ye gak kebra meglmere yegl mere ta moglsre, God na kingna mogl, na suglna morabedi yegl prabuka i, yoba i keme God yoba suglno morabara ede suna enabuka. Ba yoba yegl ta prikrabuka i, ye suna ta pikrabiwe dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 10:16" />Yegl didre, ye gak kebra swarade kugro bikie bolamugl edidre, ye ake, di wakai yei togwa.<verse eid="MRK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yagl ta mige moni mere kan yogwa i Jisas bogl ka dibrika</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Matyu 19.16-30</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Luk 18.18-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 10:17" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="Rich young ruler" file="cn01773B.tif" size="col" copy="David C Cook" ref="10.17" />Ana okuo Jisas ede bage ta enagledi ogo, yagl ta muku di ede pi Jisas omara pidre, gumamugl yage goglko bodugl, yegl dugwa, Tisa yo, yagl wakai, na siragl mere ersre, aimadi kamin kor moraiglkwa ikra kaima inagle? dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 10:18" />Yegl dugo, Jisas ye yegl di prukwa, Ene siragl pre na yagl wakai we dine? Yoba wakai ta moglkrikwa ba God swara wakai moglkwa. <verse eid="MRK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 10:19" />Ana God lomo siragl mere paugwa i, enene pitnga, Ene yoba ta si goglkre, yagl abu ta bogl kunogl nekre, taragl ta kunogl nekre, kot mina ka kibi dikre, te yoba taraglno inamnedi bakagl tekre, ene neno mano pre i mitna edidre, kano prio!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isip Kide Kodigwa 20.12-16, Lo 5.16-20</char></note> di, God lomo yegl dumiwe dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 10:20" />Jisas yegl dugo, yagl i di ikne ede, Neno Yagle, na gak mogl ede u erme wiga i pra, lo mudu i na duglo boluwe dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 10:21" />Yegl dugo, Jisas ye yagl i kan, dem muduo tedre, yegl di togwa, Ene taragl swara ta erekitnga pai moglkwa i, ene taraglnen mudu i pi topo boglsre, mige i pi goduglme yoba to! Ene yegl etn, ene heven ibo taragl wakai wakai inatnga. Te, ene yegl ersre, u na duglo boglo dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 10:22" />Jisas yegl dugo, yagl i prisre, guma dra u kide ogo, kide pre, ede ogwa. I siragl pre ye taragl mere kaima kan nogwa yagl ta moglkwa.<verse eid="MRK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 10:23" />Ana Jisas kan winabo didre, ye duglo beglkwa yagl yegl di togwa, Yoba taragl podo ere neigwa i, ye God yoba kingno mogl, suglno morabara ede suna enaiglkwa i, waragne pamiwe dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 10:24" />Jisas ka yegl dugo, ye duglo beglkwa yagl prisre, nagino keglkwa. Nagino keglkwa ba Jisas ye aglke kor yegl di togwa, Gak wagle, God yoba kingno mogl, suglno morabara yoba suna enaiglkwa i, waragne kaima pamiwe dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 10:25" />Bugla kamel ta kar nil kwie yomara ede suna enabuka i yuaglke paugwa ba yoba ta taragl podo kan neigwa i, God yoba kingno moglmara ede suna enaiglkwa i, waragne kaima pamiwe dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 10:26" />Yegl dugo, ye nagino podo koglsre, yegl di meglkwa, Yegl eran, God yoba ira ere inan, kuno erabe? digwa. <verse eid="MRK 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 10:27" />Yegl digo, Jisas ye kandre, di ikne ede yegl dugwa, Yoba ye yene ere idre, ede suna enaiglkwa ta kuno erekrabuka. Ba God taragl mudu erabuka keme paugwa pre ye ere inabuka i, waragne ta paikrumiwe dugwa.<verse eid="MRK 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 10:28" />Ana Jisas yegl dugo, Pita ye yegl di prukwa, Kano. No taraglno mudu kide kodidre, ene duglo buniwe dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 10:29" />Yegl dugo, ye yegl di togwa, Na ene kaima di teiga. Yoba swara ta na duglo boglsre, na kana wakai yoba di tenagledi ye yugumo toglmo kide kodinabuka mo agiglema abaugloma mo nem mam mo nagiglma kide kodinabo mo ye makanmo kide kodinabuka i, <verse eid="MRK 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 10:30" />ye ege erme magigl i taragl mere kide kaima ikne edenabiwe dugwa. Ye yugu togl ya agiglema abaugloma ya mano ya gagiglma ya kaya togl mere kide kaima 100 mere yegl inabuka pre diwe dugwa. Ege erme taragl yegl mere idre, yubun tau ama inabuka ba ege okuo ta yenabuka igne, ye aimadi kamin kor morabuka. <verse eid="MRK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 10:31" />Ba yoba tau mere erme mogl mitna edigwa i, okuo kagno paikran, atne kaima moraiglkwa. Te, yoba tau erme atne kaima meglkwa i, okuo mogl mitna kaima edenaiglmiwe dugwa.<verse eid="MRK 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas goglsre, adigl u kor enabuka pre aglke kor dugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Matyu 20.17-19</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Luk 18.31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 10:32" />Ana Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yagl bogl ede ido Jerusalem enamnedi konbauna pi meglko, Jisas ye gumanomugl ede okna pi moglko, ye ede Jerusalem enaiglkwa i nagino keglkwa. Nagino keglko, yoba tau ama Jisas omara sika si eigwa i ama kudugl geglkwa. Kudugl geglko, Jisas ye okna erumere ere, ye aglke kor ye duglo beglkwa yagl 12-pela di i bina edidre, ye moglmara siragl taragl plau dinabuka i, di togwa. <verse eid="MRK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 10:33" />Ene prio. Nono ede ido Jerusalem enauniwa. Omun, yoba ta na Yoba Wam moglka i, i pi tawa teigwa yoba bitno meglkwa i ya God lomo beke teigwa yoba i ogono mina yenabuka. Na i pi ye ogono mina yenan, yoba i na kotna prisre, Ene goratniwe dinaiglkwa. Didre, na i pi yugobuno pere, Juda yoba moglkrikwa i, ogono mina yebi, <verse eid="MRK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 10:34" />ye na agai goratnedi ersre, eur si narsre, ama duglnai sidre, ede prak mina na si goraiglkwa paugwa. Si geglbi, na ege suota pai mogl, adigl u kor enaluwe dugwa.<verse eid="MRK 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jems ya Jon yagl kade morabugledi pre, Jisas kira pogl pribrika</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:20-28">Matyu 20.20-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 10:35" />Ana Jems ya Jon, Sebedi wam suo ikra ere mogl, Jisas moglmara udre, yegl di pribrika, Neno Yagle, no taragl ta dubugl, ene pre noratnedi prubugle dibrika. <verse eid="MRK 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 10:36" />Yegl dibriko, Jisas ye di pre, Na siragl ere norabedi pribre? dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 10:37" />Dugo, ye di tedre, Ene erme prawe din, ene king mogl, sianen idre, ame dinatnga igne, nono ene ogon wo kra ta edin, ame dinan, ta ogon koda kra edin, ame dinan, yegl erabedi prubugle dibrika.<verse eid="MRK 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 10:38" />Jems ya Jon yegl dibrika ba Jisas di ikne ede yegl dugwa, Ene na yegl di pribrika i, pre pogl sikre, dibrika. Na nigl kide ta kogl nenaglka i, ene kogl nebr, kuno erabo? dugwa. Te, yoba ede nigl atne eigwa igne, nigl i mogl winabo di, ye i suna edumere mere yegl, yubun mere kide u na moraglmara winabo di, na i suna edenabuka. Ene yubun yegl mere ta ibr, kuno erabo? dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 10:39" />Kuno erabiwe dibrika. Yegl dibriko, Jisas aglke kor yegl dugwa, Kaima, na nigl kide ta kogl nenaglka i, ene ama kogl nedre, na yubun podo inaglmere yegl, ene yubun podo yegl inabrika. <verse eid="MRK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 10:40" />Yegl inabrika ba yoba ta na ogona wo kra ya ogona koda kra ame dinabuka i, i na mina ta paikrukwa. Na Nina ira kra ame dinaiglkwa i, yene kere i pere edugo, i keme ame dinaiglmiwe dugwa.<verse eid="MRK 10:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 10:41" />Ana Jisas duglo beglkwa yagl 10-pela ye Jems ya Jon ka yegl dibrika i prisre, ye deno kubro teigwa. <verse eid="MRK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 10:42" />Deno kubro teigo, Jisas ye agle di, wio dugo, ede magigl wigo, ye yegl di togwa, Yoba Juda yoba moglkre, yugobuno pere meglkwa i, ye yobano kade ebrie mabuno erikwa i, ene pre kan erikwa. Yobano kade, ye bitno meglme digwa i, ye yene mogl mitna edidre, yobano kan atne ede teigwa. Te, ye kingno ama ka dimere dimere i, sika sidre, yegl erio digo, erikwa. <verse eid="MRK 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 10:43" />Yegl erikwa ba ene meglmara suna i, mabuno yegl kaima ta paikrabuka. Ene meglmara suna i, ene ta kade moragledi pratnga i, ene mogl atne edidre, yoba ake ple di tenatnga paugwa. <verse eid="MRK 10:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 10:44" />Te, yoba ta mogl gumamugl edenagledi pratnga i, ene yoba mudu niglno kogono yoba mere yegl moratnga paugwa. <verse eid="MRK 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 10:45" />Na Yoba Wam moglka i, ama kuno yegl mere yoba na niglna kogona ere naraiglmedi ukrika ba na yoba niglno kogono ere tenagledi wiga. Nigl kogono ere tedre, ye pre goglsre, topono tebo, yoba kane paimara i, kide kodidre, ede meda unaiglmedi pre wiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="MRK 10:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yagl ta gumuglo koglo koglo kin yogwa i, Jisas ere wakai ere togwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Matyu 20.29-34</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Luk 18.35-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 10:46" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="Blind Bartimeus" file="FM 176 Blind Bartimaeus_6inches_BW.jpg" size="col" copy="Foundation Matters" ref="10.46" />Ana okuo Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yagl bogl ede pi dumo ta Jeriko we dimara ede suna pidre, aglke kor ede meda wigo, yoba mere kide ye wimara akie wigwa. Wigo, yagl gumuglo kin yogwa ta konbauna bina ame di mogl, ogo kugl, mige pre yana di moglkwa. Yagl i kagie Bartimeus we digwa. Kagie i, mabuno yegl mere paugwa, Timeus wam. <verse eid="MRK 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 10:47" />Ana yagl i ame di moglsre, yoba tau Jisas, Nasaret nem ikra umiwe digo, prukwa. Prisre, ka podo di yegl dugwa, Jisas yo, Devit Gawamo motnga i, na mitna goglo! dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 10:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 10:48" />Yagl i yegl dugo, yoba tau mere ye ka tedre, Ka kodo! digwa. Yegl digwa ba ye kano prikre, ka podo kaima di, Devit Gawamo motnga i, na mitna goglo! dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 10:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 10:49" />Ana Jisas u adigl moglsre, yoba tau yagl i auro yu wio dugo, yoba ere mogl, yagl i agle di, yegl digwa, Ene gun yei, adiglo! Jisas ene wo dumiwe digwa. <verse eid="MRK 10:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 10:50" />Yegl digo, yagl i ir gaglmo pia si makandigle edidre, tabre adigl, ede Jisas moglmara ogwa. <verse eid="MRK 10:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 10:51" />Ogo, Jisas ye di pre, Ene siragl ere tenaglka pre dine? dugwa. Yegl dugo, yagl i di ikne ede, Neno Yagle yo, na aglke kor kanagledi priwe dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 10:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 10:52" />Yegl dugo, Jisas di ikne ede yegl dugwa, Ene ede po. Ene na pre mediglnara pre ene gumugln u wakai omiwe dugwa. Jisas yegl dugo, yagl i gumuglo tabre kaima u wakai ogo, ye aglke kor kandre, Jisas omara duglo boglkwa.<verse eid="MRK 10:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MRK 11" />
  <para style="s">Jisas king mere yegl mogl, ede Jerusalem suna ugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Matyu 21.1-11</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luk 19.28-40</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Jon 12.12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 11:1" />Ana Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yagl bogl ede Jerusalem magigl udre, taun Betfage ya Betani muglo Oliv ibo yebrara ede magigl wigo, Jisas ye duglo biurka yoba suo dedidre,<figure style="fig" alt="Jerusalem" file="CN01782B.TIF" size="col" loc="11.1" copy="David C Cook" ref="11.1" /> <verse eid="MRK 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 11:2" />ye yegl di togwa, Ene dumo ta yomara iro suna pidre, donki ta kane kogl padiglbi, tabre kanabrika. Donki i, yoba ege swara ta au sikrikwa. Ene donki i kandre, kane poko ede, yunabrika. <verse eid="MRK 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 11:3" />Te, yoba ta ene di pre, ene siragl pre donki i kane poko edibre? dibi, ene yegl diro, Yagl Kade kogonmo ta paugwa pre dugwa ba ye tabre te ikne edenabiwe di, ene yegl diro dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 11:4" />Yegl dugo, yagl suo i ede dumo ta dumara i suna pidre, donki nagigle ta konbauna bina, yugu dramugl dua yomara kane kogl padiglko, kanibrika. Kandre, kane poko ede miurko, <verse eid="MRK 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 11:5" />yoba tau magigl adigl meglkwa i ye di pre, Ene siragl pre donki nagigle i kane poko edibre? digwa. <verse eid="MRK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 11:6" />Yegl digo, Jisas ye dinabredi di tomere i di tebriko, yoba pra we digwa. <verse eid="MRK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 11:7" />Ana yagl suo i, ye donki nagigle yu Jisas moglmara edidre, ir gaglno gugl, donki moko bolamugl kiglbriko, Jisas donki au sidre, ede ogwa. <verse eid="MRK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 11:8" />Te, ye ede omara i, yoba tau mere ir gaglno gugl, Jisas konbauna unabara kugl yeigo, te tau, ede bina dage pi, ede yaudo ya ki bru yu maginagle kugl yeigwa. <verse eid="MRK 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 11:9" />Yeigo, Jisas tebe ede pi moglkwa igne, yoba tau ede okna eigo, tau okuo wigo, Jisas yene suna ogwa. Eimara i, mudu aglage kaglkane ere, yegl digwa, God debie si tomniwa! Yagl ta Yagl Kade dedugo, ugwa i, God ye ere wakai ere tenabiwe!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Giglage 118.25-26</char></note> di, yegl didre, <verse eid="MRK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 11:10" />ye ama yegl digwa, Devit gawamo ta ugwa, Devit okna ibo no kingno moglmere no kingno morabuka i, ye debie si tedre, God heven ibo moglkwa i, debie si tomniwe di, yegl digwa.<verse eid="MRK 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 11:11" />Ana Jisas ede Jerusalem suna pidre, ede tawa teigwa yugu yomara togl suna pi, kan winabo di, taragl mudu kan kodugo, min panagledi erukwa pre ye duglo beglkwa yagl 12-pela bogl aglke ede ikne pi dumo kebra Betani we dimara eigwa.<verse eid="MRK 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas ede fik ta di kide yogwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:18-19">Matyu 21.18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 11:12" />Ana dumo Betani pi pai, tagana mogl Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yagl bogl dumo Betani kide kodo, ede eigo, Jisas kidan goglsre, <verse eid="MRK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 11:13" />ye kan eglke ede, ede fik ta yaudo si paugo, kanugwa. Kandre, ede magigl pi mogo ta kogl pamo mo di, kanugwa i, mogo ta kogl paugo kankrukwa. Ede fik i, mogo koglkwa egemo yekrukwa pre yaudo keme paugo, kandre, <verse eid="MRK 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 11:14" />ede i di kide yei te, Yoba okuo ta ene mogonen uro nekraiglmiwe dugwa. Yegl dugo, ye duglo beglkwa yagl pre meglkwa.<verse eid="MRK 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tawa teigwa yugu yomara yoba taragl tau topo beglkwa i, Jisas si meda edugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Matyu 21.12-17</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Luk 19.45-48</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Jon 2.13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 11:15" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="Overturning tables" file="CN01787B.TIF" size="span" copy="David C Cook" ref="11.15" />Ana Jisas duglo beglkwa yagl bogl ede Jerusalem suna eigo, Jisas ede tawa teigwa yugu yomara togl suna pidre, yoba taragl tau i pi topo bogl meglkwa i, si meda edugwa. Ye si meda edidre, mige topo suade erikwa yobamo i, bogl ake yake tedre, kua yumugl mige beglkwa yobamo i, siano ama ake yake tedre, <verse eid="MRK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 11:16" />ye ama tawa teigwa yugu yomara yoba taragl kane kane kake idre, konbauna i suna ede yei, ede iro pi, ede ya u, ere dinaiglmedi mane dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 11:17" />Ye mane didre, yoba ka beke te, yegl dugwa, God kamo mina bage ta beglkwa i, yegl dugwa, Na yuguna i, yoba uglo koglo koglo meglkwa i, kamage eraiglkwa dumo ta yenabiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aisaia 56.7</char></note> dugwa. Ba ene dumo i ere i kunogl gogl yoba teke paigwa dumo mere yegl edimiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jeremaia 7.11</char></note> dugwa.<verse eid="MRK 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 11:18" />Ana tawa teigwa yoba bitno meglkwa i ya God lomo beke teigwa yoba Jisas ka dugwa i prisre, ye kuduglmo podo gogl, Jisas si goramnedi konbauna dokigwa. I siragl pre yoba Jisas ka dugwa i prisre, mudu nagino kogl, wakai pre, kinano gudu meglkwa. <verse eid="MRK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 11:19" />Ana min paugo, Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yagl bogl Jerusalem kide kodo, ede meda eigwa.<verse eid="MRK 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ede fik goglmara Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yagl ka beke togwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:20-22">Matyu 21.20-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 11:20" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="fig tree" file="hk00088b.tif" size="col" copy="Horace Knowles, British Foreign and Bible Society" ref="11.20" />Ana tagugo, Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yagl bogl konbauna pi mogl, ede fik ikra kanigwa. Kanigwa i, ede fik ikra, duglane ede pi yaudo ogwa i, mudu gigle goglko, kanigwa. <verse eid="MRK 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 11:21" />Yegl eruko, yagl Pita poglo di prisre, ye Jisas yegl di togwa, Neno Yagle, kano! Ene ede fik di kide yei tenga ikra gigle goglmiwe dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 11:22" />Yegl dugo, Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yagl i mudu di tedre, Ene God yobuglomo pre medilo dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 11:23" />Na ene ka kaima di teiga. Yoba ta nomane suo yeikre, muglo magigl i di te, God ene i pi mudi nigl suna edenabiwe! didre, ye ka dugwa i kaima plau dinabedi pre medran, God ye dumere ere tenabuka. <verse eid="MRK 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 11:24" />Yegl pre na ka ta dibo, praiglkwa i, ene siragl taragl pre God agle didre, kamage ere praiglkwa i, ene i kodigwa mere yegl pre mediglbi, God ene tenabuka. <verse eid="MRK 11:24" /><verse number="25-26" style="v" sid="MRK 11:25-26" />Te, Ene adigl mogl, kamage eraiglkwa igne, yoba ta ene ere kide ere tenaiglkwa i, ene gugl ede teo! dugwa. Yegl eribi, ene Neno heven ibo moglkwa i ene tadaglme erikwa i ama gugl edenabiwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="MRK 11:25-26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ira ene kagn kade tomedi yoba kade wagle Jisas kira peglkwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Matyu 21.23-27</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Luk 20.1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 11:27" />Ana Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yagl bogl aglke kor ede ikne pi, Jerusalem suna eigo, Jisas tawa teigwa yugu yomara togl suna wan moglko, tawa teigwa yoba bitno meglkwa i ya te, God lomo beke teigwa yoba ya te, Juda yobano kade ye moglmara udre, <verse eid="MRK 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 11:28" />kira pogl pre, yegl digwa, Ira ene dedugo, taragl yegl etne? Te, ira taragl yegl ero dugwa i, no di noro! digwa. <verse eid="MRK 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 11:29" />Yegl digo, Jisas di ikne ede yegl dugwa, Na ama ka kira swara ta poglbo, ene di ikne ede naribi, ira na dedugo, kogon erika i, ene di tenagle dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 11:30" />Jon yoba nigl bugl togwa i, God dedugo, erumo mo yoba dedigo, erume? Na di nario! dugwa.<verse eid="MRK 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 11:31" />Dugo, yoba kade wagle yene meglmara di ikne ikne ede, ka di pre yegl digwa, Nono di ikne ede God ye Jon dedume dumun, yagl i ere mogl, Ene siragl eruko, Jon kamo pre mediglkrime? di norabuka. <verse eid="MRK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 11:32" />Ba nono di ikne ede, Makadigle yoba digo erume dumun, nono ama yoba kuduglno goramga paugwa. I siragl pre ye mudu prikwa i, yagl Jon i ye God kamo kep yoba kaima ta moglmedi primiwe di, yene ikne ikne yegl digwa. <verse eid="MRK 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 11:33" />Yegl paugwa pre Jisas di ikne ede te, No ta pre kan erekrumniwe digwa. Yegl digo, Jisas yegl dugwa, Yegl eran we, ira na dedugo, kogon yegl erika i, ene ta di tebo, prikraiglmiwe dugwa.<verse eid="MRK 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MRK 12" />
  <para style="s">Yoba kide ede wain sugl moglsre, mabuno kide beglkwa ka ebrie</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Matyu 21.33-46</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Luk 20.9-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 12:1" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="Vineyard watch tower" file="lb00104b.tif" size="col" loc="12.1" copy="Louise Bass, British and Foreign and Bible Society" ref="12.1" />Ana yoba kade wagle ka yegl digo, Jisas ka ebrie mina ka beke tedre, yegl dugwa, Yagl ta ede wain podo ere yaglsre, ede wain ere yaglmara togl ere winabo didre, suna wom yugu ta kei bodugl sugl kan moraiglmedi kedre, ye wain nuglo duglo inaiglmedi pre maugl ta pere yedre, erukwa. Ersre, ye ede bage ta enagledi yoba ta sugl mogl, mige teke yei naraiglmedi pre yoba ta ogono mina yedre, ede ogwa. <verse eid="MRK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 12:2" />Pi mogl prukwa i, erme wain mogo bogl yenabuka egemo yomedi prisre, ye nigl kogonmo yagl ta komono kana dedugwa. Dedidre, Ene ede wain sugl meglkwa yoba meglmara en, ye mige kia ta tebi, idre, ede ikne unatniwe didre, dedugwa. <verse eid="MRK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 12:3" />Dedugo, ogwa i, ede wain sugl meglkwa yoba i, ye si akidre, ere sidre, siragl ta tekre, yoko dedigo, ede ikne ugwa. <verse eid="MRK 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 12:4" />Ede ikne ugo, wain nem yagl aglke kor nigl kogonmo yoba ta dedugo, ede ogwa. Ba ede wain sugl meglkwa yoba i, ye bre mina sidre, agai gorabedi eriko, yoko ede ikne ugwa. <verse eid="MRK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 12:5" />Ugo, wain nem yagl ta dedugo, ogwa i, ye si geglkwa. Yegl erikwa pre makan nem yagl i ere mogl, nigl kogonmo yoba tau aglke mere dagl dedugo, ede eigwa ba wain sugl meglkwa yoba i erimere ere, nigl kogon yoba tau ere sidre, tau si geglkwa. <verse eid="MRK 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 12:6" />Yegl eriko, makan nem ye yagl swara kaima ta dedenabuka yoko moglkwa. Yagl i, ye wam, muduo suna moglkwa. Ana okuo kaima ede wain nem yagl i, nomane ta idre, Na pra wana dedibo, enan we, ye kandre, kamo praiglmiwe di prisre, ye wam dedugo, ogwa. <verse eid="MRK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 12:7" />Ba wain sugl meglkwa yoba ye kandre, yene di ikne ikne ede pre, yegl digwa, Wain nem yagl ikra wam ugwa pre siragl mudu sugl kan munga i, ye mudu inabuka umiwe digwa. Yegl pre ye si gun we, nono taragl mudu kan munga i, no nono pre yenabiwe digwa. <verse eid="MRK 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 12:8" />Yegl didre, ye ake gi di mogl, si goglsre, pia si meda edime dugwa.<verse eid="MRK 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 12:9" />Jisas yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Ana ede wain nem yagl yoba kade moglkwa i, ye erimara i siragl ere tenabedi prime? Ye ede ikne udre, ede wain sugl meglkwa yoba i mudu si gogl, ye makanmo i, yoba pere ogono wagle yenabiwe dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 12:10" />Ene God kamo mina ka yegl ta paugo, kerekrikwa paugwa. Ka i yegl dugwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:10">Kobuglo yugu keigwa yoba i,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:10">ye kobuglo gade imara i kobuglo swara ta kide yomedi kandre, kide kodigwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:10">Ba God yugu ta kenagledi kobuglo swara ta kide kodigwa i, idre,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:10">Yugu kei ede mitna enabara i,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:10">Mabunomugl mabuno bogl paduglmiwa.<verse eid="MRK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 12:11" />Yagl Kade yene yegl eruko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:11">No kandre, nagino podo kuniwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Giglage 118.22-23</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="MRK 12:11">di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="MRK 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 12:12" />Ana Jisas yegl di kodugo, yagl kade wagle ikra, ye Jisas ka ebrie dugwa i, no di boglmedi prisre, Jisas si kane sinamnedi prikwa ba ye yoba kuduglno gogl, ye kanige ersre, ede eigwa.<verse eid="MRK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Taks tenamno mo tekramnedi yoba Jisas kira peglkwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Matyu 22.15-22</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Luk 20.20-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 12:13" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="Holding coin" file="cn01790B.tif" size="col" copy="David C Cook" ref="12.13" />Ana okuo yagl kade wagle ikra ere mogl, Jisas aglau ta eran, kot tenamnedi ye Farisi yoba ya Herot yobama tau bogl akie enaiglmedi dedigo, <verse eid="MRK 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 12:14" />ye pi Jisas yegl di teigwa, Tisa yo, no prumga i, ene ka du keme didre, yoba beke tenga. Ene yoba kade meglkwa mo yoko meglkwa i kerekre, God konbaunamo kuno keme yoba beke tenga. Yegl pre ene siragl we di pitne? Nono mige taks Rom king tenamga kuno erumo mo tekramne? digwa. <verse eid="MRK 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 12:15" />Te, taks tenamno mo tekramne? di, yegl digwa. Yegl digwa ba Jisas ye bakagl narimedi kan pogl sidre, ye yegl di togwa, Ene siragl pre na aglau ere dinan, pramnedi na kira pogl prime? Ene mige silva ta naribi, kanaluwe dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 12:16" />Yegl dugo, ye mige silva ta yu teigo, Jisas mige i kandre, yegl dugwa, Ira kwiamo ya kagie mige i mina pame? dugwa. Dugo, ye di ikne ede, Rom king kagie ya kwiamo pamiwe digwa. <verse eid="MRK 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 12:17" />Yegl digo, Jisas ye yegl di togwa, Yegl eran we, taragl ta Rom king pre yenabuka i, Rom king teo. Te, taragl ta God pre yenabuka i, God teo! dugwa. Yegl dugo, ye prisre, nagino podo kiglkwa.<verse eid="MRK 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sadyusi yoba tau ere mogl, yoba adigl u kor ta pikraiglmedi Jisas kira peglkwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Matyu 22.23-33</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Luk 20.27-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 12:18" />Ana okuo, Sadyusi yoba tau Jisas moglmara wigwa. Sadyusi yoba digwa i, yoba ta goglsre, adigl u kor ta pikraiglmiwe digwa. <verse eid="MRK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 12:19" />Ka yegl didre, tau Jisas moglmara u ka yegl digwa, Tisa yo, Moses ka ta bogl norumara i, yegl dugwa, Yagl ta abu inabuka ba gak kuglkre, goran, ye agigle ta morabuka i, abu werai i inan, gak kurabrika i, nem goglkwa agaimo idre, makanmo inabiwe dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 12:20" />Moses ka bogl norumara i mina ka kira ta poramga. Aglke ta agigle agigle 7-pela meglkwa. Ta komono moglkwa i, abu ta yugwa ba ye gak kuglkre, goglkwa. <verse eid="MRK 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 12:21" />Te, agigle namba 2 moglkwa i, abu i yugwa ba ye ama gak ta kuglkre goglko, agigle namba 3 ede pi <verse eid="MRK 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 12:22" />namba 7 i mudu abu werai i idre, gak kuglkre, geglkwa. Ana okuo kaima abu i ama goglkwa. <verse eid="MRK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 12:23" />Agigle agigle 7-pela i, mudu abu swara i igwa pre yoba adigl u kor enaiglkwa igne, abu i, ira ebie morabuka i di noro! digwa.<verse eid="MRK 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 12:24" />Ana Sadyusi yoba yegl digo, Jisas ye di ikne ede te, yegl dugwa, Ene God kamo pre pogl sikre, God yobuglomo siragl mere paugwa i, ama pre pogl sikrikwa pre ene nomano kugl dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 12:25" />Yoba adigl u kor enaiglkwa igne, ye abu idre, ede yagl pidre, erimere yegl ta erekraiglkwa ba angelo heven ibo meglmere yegl moraiglkwa. <verse eid="MRK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 12:26" />Ba yoba geglkwa ka kaima adigl u kor enaiglkwa paugwa i, Moses kaima i nogugl ede kodugwa ba ene kere kankrikwa paugwa. Okna ibo God ede kebra ta de bauglo erumara u suna moglsre, yegl dugwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:26">Na yagl Abraham, ya Aisak, ya Jekop Godno mogl pai moluwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isip Kide Kodigwa 3.6</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="MRK 12:26">dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 12:27" />God kamo yegl dugwa i, ye yoba gogl kodigwa i, Godno moglkwa pre dikrukwa ba yoba kor mogl pai meglkwa i, Godno moglkwa pre dugwa. Ene siragl mere pre mediglkwa i, aglau podo erimiwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="MRK 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lo swara ta podo pai, mudu egre togwa pre dugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:34-40">Matyu 22.34-40</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luk 10.25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 12:28" />Ana ye ka drano yegl di meglko, God lomo beke togwa yagl ta u prukwa. Pre moglsre, Jisas ye di ikne ede togwa i, wakai dumedi prisre, ye Jisas kira pogl, yegl dugwa, God lomo paimara suna i, siragl lo podo pai, lo tau egre tome? dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 12:29" />Yegl dugo, Jisas yegl di togwa, Lo ta podo pai, mudu egre togwa i, yegl pame dugwa, Israel yoba, ene prio! Yagl Kade nono Godno moglkwa i, ye swara Yagl Kade moglkwa. <verse eid="MRK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 12:30" />Yegl pre ene den mudun bogl mudu Yaglnen Kade God tedre, ene nomanen, ya yobugln bogl mudu, te ene mudu motnere God to<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lo 6.4-5</char></note> dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 12:31" />Te, lo ta mokomugl paugwa i, yegl paugwa, Ene enene wakai kanere mere yegl, yoba ta magigl akie kipanaiglkwa i, ama yegl mere wakai kano<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tawa Teigwa 19.18</char></note> dugwa. Lo suo i podo pai, lo tau mudu egre tebriwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="MRK 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 12:32" />Ana Jisas ka yegl di kodugo, yagl i di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Neno Yagle, ene ka kaima diniwe dugwa. Ene di notnga, God swara moglko, god pere ta moglkrikwa pre dinga i, ya te, <verse eid="MRK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 12:33" />deno muduno bogl, ya nomano ya yobuglno bogl mudu God tedre, no nono wakai kanumnere mere yegl, yoba ta magigl akie kipamga i, ama yegl mere wakai kanamga pre dinga i, ka kaima podo padre, tawa mudu gagl tege ere tenamga ya tawa mudu siragl mere tenamga i, ka kaima egre tomiwe dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 12:34" />Yegl dugo, Jisas ye dugwa i, pre pogl sidre, dumedi kandre, ye yegl di togwa, God yoba kingno mogl, suglno morabara i, ene ede suna ukitnga ba ede magigl uniwe dugwa. Yegl dugo, mokomugl i, yoba okuo kira poraiglkwa i, kudugl geglkwa.<verse eid="MRK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">God Kere Yugwa Yagle, ye Devit gawamo keme ta moglkrabuka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Matyu 22.41-46</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Luk 20.41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 12:35" />Ana okuo Jisas ye tawa teigwa yugu yomara togl suna mogl, yoba ka beke te moglsre, yegl dugwa, God lomo beke teigwa yoba ene ka swara ta beke teigwa i, yegl digwa, God Kere Yugwa Yagle ta unabuka i, King Devit Gawamo ta unabiwe di, yegl digwa. Ba ye yoba yoko moran, kuno erabedi primo? <verse eid="MRK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 12:36" />God Kere Yugwa Yagl yoba yoko ta moglkrabuka i, nogugl paugwa. I siragl pre God Murubuglo ye okna ibo King Devit nomane togo, Devit ere mogl, ka ta God Kere Yugwa Yagl pre yegl boglkwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">Neno Kade ere mogl, na Yaglna Kade yegl di togwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:36">Ene ogona wo kra ame di moglo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">Na ene kudanen ikne yobuglo ere tedre,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:36">kagln mina atne edinaluwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Giglage 110.1</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="MRK 12:36">di, yegl dume dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 12:37" />Devit yene God Kere Yugwa Yagl i pre na Yaglna Kade we dugwa ba yoba tau Devit gawamo morabe digwa i we, siragl pre ka yegl dime? Na di nario, dugwa. Dugo, yoba mere kide pre meglkwa i gun yei, grigle digwa.<verse eid="MRK 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">God lomo beke teigwa yoba pre kan kun erio!</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Matyu 23.1-36</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 11:37-54">Luk 11.37-54</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 20:45-47">20.45-47</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 12:38" />Jisas ka beke te moglsre, yegl dugwa, God lomo beke teigwa yoba ene bakagl te dinaiglmiwa. Ye gagl suna olto, wakai yogwa i edinamnedi prisre, ye maket wanigwa igne yoba ye wakai we di teigwa i, gun podo yeigwa. <verse eid="MRK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 12:39" />Te, ka mabuno yugu yugugl eigwa igne mo yoba kaya mokna podo gaiglkwa igne, ye sia wakai, gumamugl iro ame dinamnedi prikwa. <verse eid="MRK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 12:40" />Ba ye abu werai meglmara bakagl te, yuguno toglno kunogl idre, ama yoba wakai muniwedi kamage olto kuri kaima erikwa. Yegl pre God yoba ka tage tenabuka igne, ye ka podo kaima inaiglmiwe, dugwa.<verse eid="MRK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abu werai ta mige mogo gogl suo God togwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 21:1-4">Luk 21.1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 12:41" />Okuo Jisas ede tawa teigwa yugu pidre, mige boks yomara bina ia ame di mogl, yoba mige ofa tenamnedi mige i pi boks mina atne edigo, kan moglkwa. Kan moglko, mige podo kan neigwa yoba mere u mige podo boks i mina atne edigwa. <verse eid="MRK 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 12:42" />Edigo, abu werai ta goduglme moglkwa mige mogo gogl suo ta i pi atne edugo, kanugwa. Mige mogo gogl suo togwa i, mige kebra kide yogwa. <verse eid="MRK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 12:43" />Kandre, ye duglo beglkwa yagl ede magigl wio didre, yegl dugwa, Na ene kaima di teiga, abu werai goduglme moglkwa i, mige podo togo, mudu mige kebra teigwa. <verse eid="MRK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 12:44" />I siragl pre ye mudu mige podo kawa tomara i mina ofa teigwa ba abu werai i, mige ta kan nomere mudu togwa. Ye migemo tau yoko yenan, ye ere nenabuka i ta yeikrume, dugwa.<verse eid="MRK 12:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MRK 13" />
  <para style="s">Yoba tawa teigwa yugu ere kide eraiglkwa i pre Jisas dugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Matyu 24.1-2</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 21:5-6">Luk 21.5-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 13:1" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="Jerusalem" file="hk00379b.tif" size="span" copy="Horace Knowles, British and Foreign Bible Society" ref="13.1">Siti Jerusalem ya God yugumo yegl mere yogwa</figure>Ana Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yagl bogl tawa teigwa yugu yomara togl suna meglmara i kide kodo, ede meda eigo, ye duglo beglkwa yagl swara ta kan ikne ede, tawa teigwa yugu kandre, Jisas di te, yegl dugwa, Neno Yagle, ene tawa teigwa yugu yomara yugu tau mere keigwa i kano! dugwa. Yoba kobuglo tau podo kide idre, yugu tau keigwa i, wakai kaima kemiwe di, Jisas duglo boglkwa yagl ta yegl dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 13:2" />Yegl dugo, Jisas ye di te, yegl dugwa, Ene yugu magigl kan dinga i, okuo yoba udre, yugu i si gur di atne edibi, kobuglo swara ta kobuglo ta yenabara tebe ta yeikrabiwe dugwa.<verse eid="MRK 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yubun podo podo okuo plau dinaiglkwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Matyu 24.3-14</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 21:7-19">Luk 21.7-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 13:3" />Ana Jisas tawa teigwa yugu yomara kide kodo, ede pi koglo ibo kra pidre, muglo meglbi Muglo Oliv we dimara pi ame di moglko, Pita yogo, Jems yogo, Jon ya Andru ye keme u, Jisas moglmara yegl di prikwa, <verse eid="MRK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 13:4" />Ene taragl yegl mere plau dinabe dinga i, aunake plau dinabe? Te, no siragl taragl kandre, taragl i plau dinabuka i, magigl erumedi pramne? digwa.<verse eid="MRK 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 13:5" />Yegl digo, Jisas yegl dugwa, Yoba ta ene bakagl te dinaiglmedi kan kun erio. <verse eid="MRK 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 13:6" />I siragl pre yoba tau mere na kagna mina udre, Na Krais moliwe didre, yoba mere bakagl tenaiglkwa.<verse eid="MRK 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 13:7" />Te, yoba tau kuda beglme dibi, prisre, kuda yegl yegl plau dinarume dibi, ene ama praiglkwa ba ene kudugl goglkrio. I siragl pre taragl yegl mudu plau dinaiglkwa paugwa ba taragl pra pra dudunabuka ege i, okuo kaima unabuka. <verse eid="MRK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 13:8" />Kantri ikne ikne kuda beglbi, te, king ikne ikne ama kuda boraiglkwa. Imem podo podo unan, bage tau kidan podo kaima panaiglkwa. Taragl yegl mere mudu plau dinaiglkwa i, abu ta gak kuragledi mabuno bogl gagie giugl prumere mere yegl mere panabuka.<verse eid="MRK 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 13:9" />Te, ene yoba pre kan kun erio! Ye ene si kane sidre, kot ere tedre, ka mabuno yuguno yenabara ene duglnai sinaiglkwa. Yegl ersre, ene na duglo beglmedi ene gudu i pi king ya gavana moraiglmara edenaiglkwa. Edibi, na kana yoba kade wagle ya yugobuno pere pere ta moraiglkwa i, ama di tenaiglkwa. <verse eid="MRK 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 13:10" />Yoba na kana wakai yogwa i komono kana di tebi, yoba yugobuno pere pere uglo koglo koglo meglkwa i pribi, taragl mudu dudunabuka ege ikra okuo plau dinabuka. <verse eid="MRK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 13:11" />Ene i pi kot wagle edenaiglkwa igne, ene ka siragl mere kot mina di ikne ede tenaiglkwa i pre, pre yubun dekrio. Pre yubun dekre, God ka siragl mere ene di tenaiglmere mere igne i, ene tenabuka. Tenan, dinaiglkwa igne, ene digwa mere yegl ta paikrabuka ba Mudu Murubuglo ene drano mina ka dugwa mere yegl panabiwe dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 13:12" />Ana yegl panan, yoba yene agroma i pi kot wagle edibi, ye si goraiglkwa. Te, yoba gagroma ere mogl, yene neno mano kano sedidre, i pi kot wagle edibi, yoba ye si goraiglkwa. <verse eid="MRK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 13:13" />Te, ene na duglo beglmedi yoba mudu ene kide kanaiglkwa. Ba yoba ta ibun idre, adigl gigledi mogl enan, ege kide i dudinan, God ye ere inabiwe dugwa.<verse eid="MRK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas taragl kide kaima ta plau dinabuka pre dugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:15-28">Matyu 24.15-28</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Luk 21.20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 13:14" />Ana Jisas ka ta ama yegl dugwa, Taragl ta God gumuglo mina kide kaima yogo, taragl mudu ere kide erabuka i,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Daniel 9.27, 11.31, 12.11</char></note> dumo mawagl mina bodugl padiglbi, ene kanaiglkwa. (Prio. Yoba ta ka magigl paugwa kerenatnga i, pre pogl suo!) Ana ege i, yoba ta distrik Judia suna moraiglkwa i, ye teke ede muglo paimara ebi, <verse eid="MRK 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 13:15" />yoba yugu idaule moraiglkwa i, ye taragl ta yugugl yenabuka ikre, tabre teke ede ebi, <verse eid="MRK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 13:16" />te, yoba kaya mokna ere yaiglmara kogon ere meglkwa i, ede ikne u kugugl gaglno wakai inamnedi erekre, mudu teke edenaiglkwa. <verse eid="MRK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 13:17" />Igne i, abu dano panabuka mo gak kebra am te moraiglkwa i, mitno erabuka. <verse eid="MRK 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 13:18" />Te, ene teke ede enaiglkwa ege i, ir erabuka ege yei dinabedi kamage erio! <verse eid="MRK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 13:19" />Igne i, yubun podo kide kaima plau dinabuka. God dumo makan ere yogwa igne, ede u erme pra, yubun yegl mere ta plau dikrukwa. Te, okuo ama yegl ta plau dikrabuka. <verse eid="MRK 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 13:20" />Ege kide plau dinabuka i, Yagl Kade tabre ta ere i sugunagle edekran, yoba mudu goraiglkwa mere yegl panabuka pre ye ere i sugunagle edenabuka. Ba ye yoba tau kere igrawa we di prisre, ege i, ere i sugunagle edenabiwe dugwa.<verse eid="MRK 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 13:21" />Ege i, yoba tau ene yegl di tenaiglkwa, Ene kanio! Krais magigl i moglmiwe didre, Ye bage ta iro moglmiwe dinaiglkwa. Ba ye yegl dibi, ene ye pre mediglkrio. <verse eid="MRK 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 13:22" />I siragl pre yoba ka kibi didre, Krais muniwe dinaiglkwa i, mere unaiglkwa. Te, ka kep yoba kibi meglkwa i, mere udre, kimagl ya diu podo ere, yoba bakagl tenaiglkwa. Te, ta kuno eran, God yoba ta kere i pere edugwa meglkwa i, ama bakagl tenaiglkwa. <verse eid="MRK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 13:23" />Yegl eraiglkwa ba na erme eglke pai moglko, siragl taragl okuo plau dinabuka i, ene di te kodiga pre ene kan kun ere molo! di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="MRK 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yoba Wam ede ikne unabuka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Matyu 24.29-31</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Luk 21.25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 13:24" />Ana Jisas yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 13:24">Yubun podo kide yegl unan, mokomugl i ade ake mim eran, ba ama abuglage sikrabiwa. <verse eid="MRK 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 13:25" />Kugl kuri paigwa i, yage makadigle sibi, taragl tau heven ibo giglede paigwa i, ama piga kar dinaiglmiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aisaia 13.10, 34.4</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="MRK 13:25">dugwa.<verse eid="MRK 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 13:26" />Taragl yegl plau dinan, na Yoba Wam moglka i, kamun mitna ibo plau didre, na yobuglna ya abuglagena podo paugwa i nogugl edibo, na kanaiglmiwe dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 13:27" />U plau dibo, yoba na kanibi, na angelo dedibo, ye ede uglo koglo koglo pi, yoba God kere yugwa meglkwa i, yu makai sinaiglkwa. Ye ade umara ya ade beimara pidre, te nigl bre ya nigl beye pidre, na yobanama yu makai sinaiglmiwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="MRK 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yoba ede fik kandre, nomane inaiglkwa ka padum</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Matyu 24.32-35</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Luk 21.29-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 13:28" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="fig tree" file="lb00380b.tif" size="col" copy="Louise Bass, British Foreign and Bible Society" ref="13.28" />Ana Jisas ka yegl di kodidre, ye ka ebrie swara ta yegl di togwa, Ede fik paugwa i, poglo di prisre, nomane io. Ede fik yogagle ake wida dugo, yaudo sugwa igne, ene kandre, niga dinabuka ege i yenabiwe di primere <verse eid="MRK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 13:29" />na taragl tau plau dinaiglme diga i plau dibi, ene kandre, na ede ikne unaglka igne i ede magigl u kodumedi praiglmiwe dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 13:30" />Jisas yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Na ene ka kaima di teiga, Yoba erme meglkwa i goglkre, yoko meglbi, taragl yegl mere mudu plau di kodinan, okuo goraiglkwa. <verse eid="MRK 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 13:31" />Kamun mitna ibo ya dumo makan dudunabuka ba na kana ta dudukre, aimadi kamun pai morabiwe dugwa.<verse eid="MRK 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas ere mogl, Na aunake unaglka, yoba ta prikrime dugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:36-44">Matyu 24.36-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 13:32" />Jisas yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Na aunake igne unaglka i, ade kwia mo ege i, yoba ta pre kan erekrikwa. Yoba ta pre kan erekriko, angelo heven ibo meglkwa i pre kan erekriko, te na God Wam moglka i ama pre kan erekrika. Na Nina swara ege i pre kan erukwa. <verse eid="MRK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 13:33" />Kuno yegl mere na aunake unaglka i, ene pre kan erekrikwa pre kwi ere molo! dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 13:34" />Jisas yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, I siragl pre na unaglka igne i yegl mere pame dinaglka. Yagl ta ede bage ta enagledi ersre, yene nigl kogonmo yoba na taraglna sugl mogl naraiglmedi yubu si tedre, yagl ta yugu dua sugl moglkwa yagle i ye yugu dua sugl morabedi dedenabuka. <verse eid="MRK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 13:35" />Kuno yegl mere ene ama sugl molo! Ene yugu nem aunake unabuka i, ene prikrikwa. Ye min panan unabo mo eduer suna unabo mo koduagle wi sinan unabo mo, tagna mogl unabo mo i, ene prikrikwa pre <verse eid="MRK 13:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 13:36" />ene sugl moglkre, ugl pai meglbi, ye tabre u ene ugl pai moraiglkwa i kanan, i kide panabiwa. <verse eid="MRK 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 13:37" />Na ene sugl molo diga i, ene na ka diga pre meglkwa i pre didre, yoba mudu pre diwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="MRK 13:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MRK 14" />
  <para style="s">Yoba kade Jisas si goramnedi konbo dokigwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Matyu 26.1-5</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luk 22.1-2</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Jon 11.45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 14:1" />Ana ye ege suo meglbi, God ye okna ibo Israel yoba oglo sugwa pre meglkwa igne ikra ya te, bret yis edekre, gagl neigwa ege kade i, plau dinabuka. Yegl eruko, igne i tawa teigwa yoba bitno meglkwa i ya te, God lomo beke teigwa i, ye Jisas siragl mere ugl mage ere, si akidre, si goraiglmere pre konbauna doko wan meglkwa. <verse eid="MRK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 14:2" />Ba ye digwa i, Ege kade yoba makai sinaiglkwa igne Jisas ta si kane sikramga paugwa. Ta si kane sumun, kowai yoba kide prisre, kuda eramnedi eribi, kide panabiwa.<verse eid="MRK 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abu ta kugo nuglo ta demene wakai erukwa toide Jisas bre mina edugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Matyu 26.6-13</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Jon 12.1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 14:3" />Ana Jisas dumo Betani moglsre, ede pi yagl ta kagie Saimon we digwa i, kipamara yugugl ogwa. Yagl Saimon i, okna sik leprosi paugwa. Ana Jisas kaya mokna nenagledi ame di moglko, abu ta nigl migi kobuglo mina bekigwa ta idre, ugwa. Nigl migi atne i, kugo nuglo ta demene wakai erukwa ta kagie nard we digwa moglkwa. Te, kugo nuglo i, mige podo boglkwa. Ana abu i, ede Jisas moglmara u kugo migi i dra mina si buko di, kugo nuglo toide bre mina edugwa. <verse eid="MRK 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 14:4" />Toide bre mina edugo, yoba tau Jisas bogl akie yugugl meglkwa i kandre, kide pre, yegl digwa, Abu i kugo nuglo yoko toide yar edugwa. <verse eid="MRK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 14:5" />Ye kugo nuglo i pi mige boglma, mige silva 300 imna, mige i pi goduglme yoba tomgo we didre, abu i ka teigwa. <verse eid="MRK 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 14:6" />Ka teigwa ba Jisas ye yoba i yegl di togwa, Ene siragl pre abu i yubun teime? Ye mabuno wakai ta ere narukwa. <verse eid="MRK 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 14:7" />Goduglme yoba ene meglmara ege ege moraiglkwa pre ene aunake ta ye ere wakai ere tenamnedi praiglkwa i, eraiglkwa keme paugwa. Ba na we, na ene bogl aimadi akie moglkramga. <verse eid="MRK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 14:8" />Yegl pre abu i kuno erabara erukwa. Ye kugo nuglo yu toide ogona nagna mina edugwa i, na maugl sinaiglkwa pre erukwa. <verse eid="MRK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 14:9" />Te, na ene kaima di teiga, yoba ta na kana wakai i pi uglo koglo koglo dinaiglmara i, ye abu i erumere i ama yoba boglo kugl tebi, poglo di praiglmiwe dugwa.<verse eid="MRK 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Judas Jisas i pi kuda ikne ogono mina yenagle dugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Matyu 26.14-16</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Luk 22.3-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 14:10" />Ana igne i Judas Iskariot, ye Jisas duglo beglkwa yagl 12-pela meglmara i swarano ta moglkwa ye Jisas i pi tawa teigwa yoba bitno meglkwa i ogono wagle yenagledi prisre, ye meglmara ogwa. <verse eid="MRK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 14:11" />Ye pi meglmara dugo, yoba kade wagle i gun yedre, mige silva tau Judas tenamnedi ka di keglkwa. Ka di keglko, Judas ye ege wakai ta yenan, Jisas auro yu kudamo ikne ogono wagle yenagledi sugl moglkwa.<verse eid="MRK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas duglo beglkwa yagl bogl kaya mokna neigwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Matyu 26.17-25</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:7-14">Luk 22.7-14</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">22.21-23</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Jon 13.21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 14:12" />Ana yoba bret yis edekre gagl neigwa igne ikra plau dugo, ye sipsip si gogl, tawa tedre, God nono kowano awano oglo sumedi praiglkwa paugwa. Ege i yogo, Jisas duglo beglkwa yagl ye moglmara udre, yegl digwa, God Israel yoba oglo sumedi pre moramnedi kaya mokna nenamga i, no dumo aglo mere ere wakai ere tenamne? digwa. <verse eid="MRK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 14:13" />Yegl digo, Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yagl suo dedidre, yegl di togwa, Ene ede taun suna ebr, yagl ta nigl migi kake yunan, ene ye tegigl yedre, ene sika si pi <verse eid="MRK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 14:14" />yugu ta ede yugugl enabara i, ene ama ede yugugl piro. Ene ama pidre, yugu nem kandre, yegl di tero, No tisano ene yegl di prukwa, God nono oglo sugwa i, na duglo beglkwa yoba bogl pre moramnedi kaya mokna nenamga i, agai aglo mere mogl nenamne? di, tisano yegl dumiwe diro. <verse eid="MRK 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 14:15" />Ene yegl dibr, yugu nem ene agre ede kuglo ibo pidre, agai kade ta tenabuka. Ana kiule i tebol ya ki yei, ere wakai ere kodigwa. Ye dumo i ene obuno di tenan, ene dumo i ere wakai eribr, nono kaya mokna akie nenamniwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 14:16" />Jisas yegl dugo, yagl suo i ede taun suna pidre, taragl kane kane Jisas plau dinabedi dumere mudu plau dugo, kanibrika. Kandre, God ye Israel yoba oglo sugwa i, pre moramnedi kaya mokna ere wakai eribrika.<verse eid="MRK 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 14:17" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="Last Supper" file="FM 180_Last Supper_6inches_BW.jpg" size="col" copy="Foundatiion Matters" ref="14.17" />Ana min paugo, Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yagl 12-pela ikra bogl yugu ere wakai erimara ikra ede yugugl eigwa. <verse eid="MRK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 14:18" />Ede yugugl pi, tebol yomara ame di, winabo di, kaya mokna ne meglko, Jisas yegl dugwa, Na ene ka kaima di teiga, ene meglmara suna i, yagl swarano ta na bogl akie kaya mokna nobuglka i, na i pi kudana ikne ogono wagle yenabiwe di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 14:19" />Yegl dugo, ye duglo beglkwa yagl deno muduno yubun podo dogo, ye swara swarade Jisas di pre, Na pre ta din we di, yegl digwa. <verse eid="MRK 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 14:20" />Digo, Jisas di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Yagl diga i, ene na duglo beglkwa yagl 12-pela meglmara suna i moglmiwe dugwa. Ye na bogl akie bret idre, sup swara mina si bai, nobuluwe dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 14:21" />Na Yoba Wam moglka i, God kamo dumere yegl na kaima goraglka paugwa ba yagl ta na i pi kudana ikne ogono mina yenabuka i, ye yubun podo inabuka. Ye mam ye ta kuglkruma, wakai paugo we dugwa.<verse eid="MRK 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yoba bret ya nigl wain togwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Matyu 26.26-30</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:15-20">Luk 22.15-20</ref>, <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 Korin 11.23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 14:22" />Ana Jisas duglo beglkwa yagl bogl kaya mokna ne meglko, Jisas bret ta idre, God di wakai yei te, bret i ake buko dugwa. Ake buko di, ye swara swarade nenaiglmedi tedre, yegl dugwa, Bret i idre, neo. I na nagna mere yegl yomiwe dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 14:23" />Ana Jisas kap ta wain nuglo atne moglkwa ama idre, ye duglo beglkwa yoba nenaiglmedi tedre, ye mudu neigwa. <verse eid="MRK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 14:24" />Neigo, Jisas yegl dugwa, Wain nuglo i, na bormaina mere yegl yomiwe dugwa. Na bormaina God kontrakmo ikra pre teiga. Bormai i yoba mere kide pre yage meda sumiwa. <verse eid="MRK 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 14:25" />Te, na ene kaima di teiga, na erme nigl wain nekre, mogl ebo, God yoba kingno mogl, ye suglno morabuka egemo yenan, na aglke kor nenaluwe dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 14:26" />Jisas ka yegl di kodugo, ye duglo beglkwa yagl bogl giglage kaima ta didre, yugugl ta meglmara i kide kodo, ede muglo Oliv we dimara eigwa.<verse eid="MRK 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pita ye Jisas pre kan erekriwe dinabuka i pre Jisas di poglkwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Matyu 26.31-35</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luk 22.31-34</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Jon 13.36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 14:27" />Eigo, Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yagl yegl di togwa, Erme eduer ene mudu mokono nare, ede pere pere enaiglkwa. Ebi, God kamo okna beglkwa i, kaima plau dinabuka. God kamo bage i yegl dugwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 14:27">Na sipsip sugl moglkwa yagl i sibo, sipsip mudu ede pere pere enaiglmiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sekeraia 13.7</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="MRK 14:27">di, God kamo yegl dume dugwa. Yegl dugwa pre ene mudu na kide kodo, teke ede pere pere enaiglmiwe dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 14:28" />Yegl dugwa ba na adigl u kor enaglka igne i, na ede okna u distrik Galili moglbo, tegigl yenamniwe dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 14:29" />Jisas yegl dugo, Pita ye di ikne ede te, yegl dugwa, Yoba mudu ene mokono tebi, tenaiglkwa ba na ta tekraluwe dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 14:30" />Yegl dugo, Jisas ye di te, yegl dugwa, Na ene kaima di teiga, erme eduer koduagle kumugl wi ege suo ta sikran, ege suota na ye ta kankriwe dinatniwe dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 14:31" />Dugwa ba Pita kor dagl ka giglede di, yegl dugwa, Na ene bogl akie gorabuglka mere panan, gorabuglka ba na kaima ene mokona ta tekraluwe dugwa. Pita dumere yegl Jisas duglo beglkwa yagl mudu ama yegl digwa.<verse eid="MRK 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas dumo Getsemani pidre, kamage erukwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Matyu 26.36-46</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Luk 22.39-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 14:32" />Ana Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yagl bogl ede dumo ta Getsemani we dimara eigwa. Eigo, Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yagl yegl di togwa, Ene magigl i ame di molo dugwa. Na ede ido pi, kamage eragle dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 14:33" />Ye yegl didre, Pita, ya Jems, ya Jon yagl suota i keme idre, ede ido ogwa. Ede ido pidre, Jisas kide kaima prisre, dem muduo yubun podo kaima dogwa. <verse eid="MRK 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 14:34" />Yegl eruko, ye yagl suota i yegl di togwa, Na dena mudna yubun podo dogo, na goraglka mere yegl paugwa. Ene magigl i ugl paikre, sugl kan molo! dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 14:35" />Yegl didre, kuri ta ede iro pi, yage mage di, makan mina emine ere, ye yubun podo kide kaima inabuka i, kide pre, konbauna pere ta yomo mo di, kamage ere, <verse eid="MRK 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 14:36" />yegl dugwa, Nina yo, ene siragl ta eragledi pitnga i, eratnga keme paugwa. Konbauna ta yenan, na nigl kide kogl nenaglka i, i eglke ede naratnedi prika. Ba na nana primere ta erekraglka. Ene pitnere eraluwe dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 14:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 14:37" />Ana Jisas kamage yegl ere kodidre, ede u ye duglo beglkwa yagl suota meglmara udre, kanugwa i, ye ugl pai meglko, kanugwa. Kandre, Pita yegl di prukwa, Saimon yo, ene ugl pai motno? Ene aua swara keme kor moratnga i, kuno erekrumo? <verse eid="MRK 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 14:38" />Yagl kide ene kinano si dinabedi kor mogl, kamage ere, ugl paikrio. Ene nomano mina wakai eramnedi prikwa ba ene ogono nagino mina yobuglno paikrumiwe dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 14:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 14:39" />Jisas yegl didre, ye aglke kor ede ikne pi, God kamage ere te, ka okna dumere i, kuno yegl mere dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 14:40" />Yegl didre, aglke kor u kanugwa i, ugl pai meglko, kanugwa. Ye ugl podo geglkwa pre ugl paigwa. Ana Jisas u kandre, uglno yokugo, ye Jisas kandre, ye ka siragl mere ye di tenaiglkwa i, prikrikwa.<verse eid="MRK 14:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 14:41" />Ana Jisas kamage ere kodidre, ege namba 3 ede ikne u ye meglmara yegl dugwa, Ene siragl pre ugl kanana pai meglme? Prio. Ege ikra u kodugwa. Yoba ta na Yoba Wam moglka i, i pi tadaglme yoba ogono mina yei kodumiwa. <verse eid="MRK 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 14:42" />Ene adigl ede wio. Yagl ta na i pi kudana ikne ogono mina yenabuka i, uma, kanio dugwa.<verse eid="MRK 14:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Judas ye Jisas kudamo ikne auro yugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Matyu 26.47-56</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luk 22.47-53</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">Jon 18.3-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43-44" style="v" sid="MRK 14:43-44" />Ana Jisas ka yegl di moglko, yoba mere bainet ya kuba ki akidre, wigwa. Wimara suna i, yagl Judas ye duglo beglkwa yagl 12-pela meglmara swarano ta moglsre, Jisas i pi kudamo ikne ogono mina yenabuka yagl ikra akie wigwa. Te, yoba wigwa i, yagl kade wagle tawa teigwa bitno yoba, ya God lomo beke teigwa yoba, ya te Juda yoba kade dedigo, wigwa. Ana Judas komono kana ye di tedre, Na yoba ta pauna si nenaglka i, yoba i moglmedi kandre, ye si ake gi didre, i ede enaiglmiwe dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 14:43-44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 14:45" />Ana yagl Judas i yoba tau mere bogl akie wigo, yagl i tabre ede Jisas moglmara pidre, Neno Yagle yo didre, pauna si nogwa. <verse eid="MRK 14:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 14:46" />Yegl eruko, yoba wigwa i kandre, Jisas ake gi di mogl, si kane sigwa. <verse eid="MRK 14:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 14:47" />Si kane sigwa ba yagl swara ta magigl moglkwa i, bainetmo idre, tawa teigwa yoba bitno moglkwa i niglmo kogonmo yagl ta kina si bugl di edugwa. <verse eid="MRK 14:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 14:48" />Si bugl di edugo, Jisas yoba mudu i yegl di togwa, Na kunogl gogl yoba ta moglko, ene bainet ya kuba mina na si akenamnedi wimo? <verse eid="MRK 14:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 14:49" />Na tawa teigwa yugu yomara ege ege mogl, yoba ka beke te moglka ba na si akekrikwa. Ba siragl erme plau dugwa i, God kamo okna beglkwa i mogo korabedi pre plau dumiwe dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 14:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 14:50" />Yegl dugo, ye duglo beglkwa yagl mudu Jisas moglmara kide kodo, teke ede eigwa.<verse eid="MRK 14:50" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yagl kulu ta teke ede ogwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 14:51" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="Jesus arrested" file="cn01814B.tif" size="col" copy="David C Cook" ref="14.51" />Ana Jisas ye si kane si i ede eigo, yagl kulu ta lap kruo ta were, ogo gagie si bi di, ye eimara mokonomugl ogwa. Eimara mokonomugl ogo, yoba Jisas si kane sigwa i ye kandre, ye si akenamnedi eriko, <verse eid="MRK 14:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 14:52" />ye lap kruo ikra gugl kide kodo, yokoko teke ede ogwa.<verse eid="MRK 14:52" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas i pi Kaunsil meglmara edidre, kot ere teigwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57-68">Matyu 26.57-68</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:54-55">Luk 22.54-55</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:63-71">22.63-71</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:13-14">Jon 18.13-14</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">18.19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 14:53" />Ana ye Jisas ake i pi tawa teigwa yoba bitno moglmara i edigwa. Edigo, tawa teigwa yoba kade meglkwa i mudu yeigo, Juda yoba yobano kade yeigo, God lomo beke teigwa yoba yeigo, kwade makai si kodigwa. <verse eid="MRK 14:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 14:54" />Te, Jisas auro i ede eimara i, Pita okuo mokonomugl sika si ede pi tawa teigwa bitno yagl kipamara ede togl suna eimara ede ogwa. Suna pidre, kibr nem tau ede ere gagl, pre meglmara i, ama suna mogl, ede pre moglkwa.<verse eid="MRK 14:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 14:55" />Ana tawa teigwa yoba bitno meglkwa i, ye Kaunsil bogl mudu makai sidre, yoba tau kot mina Jisas aglau podo yegl erume dibi, si goramnedi dokigwa ba yoba swara yegl mere ta doko kankrikwa. <verse eid="MRK 14:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 14:56" />Yoba tau mere udre, ka kibi digwa ba ye kano u swara pikrukwa. <verse eid="MRK 14:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MRK 14:57" />Yegl eruko, yoba tau adigl mogl, ka kibi di, Jisas yegl dumiwe digwa, <verse eid="MRK 14:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MRK 14:58" />Yagl i, Yoba keme ere mogl, tawa teigwa yugu keigwa i, na si gur di atne ede, ege suota mina aglke kor kei kodinaglka ba yoba ye ogono mina ta kekraiglmiwe di, yegl dugo, no prumne digwa. <verse eid="MRK 14:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MRK 14:59" />Yegl digwa ba ye ka digwa i ama di pere pere ede, di swara edekrikwa. <verse eid="MRK 14:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MRK 14:60" />Ana yoba i, yegl digo, tawa teigwa yoba bitno moglkwa i, adiglsre, Jisas yegl di prukwa, Yoba ene aglau yegl yegl etne digwa i, ene di ikne edekratno? dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 14:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MRK 14:61" />Dugwa ba Jisas ka swara ta di ikne edekrukwa. Di ikne edekruko, tawa teigwa yoba bitno moglkwa i Jisas yegl di togwa, Ene God Kere Yugwa Yagle moglsre, no God debie sumga i, Wam motno? dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 14:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="MRK 14:62" />Yegl dugo, Jisas ye di te, yegl dugwa, Dinga i, na Moliwe dugwa. Na Yoba Wam moglka i, okuo God Yobuglomo Podo Paugwa i, ogo wo kra ame didre, kamun kua mina ibo wibo, ene kanaiglmiwe dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 14:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MRK 14:63" />Yegl dugo, tawa teigwa yoba bitno moglkwa i, yene kuguglmo gaglmo ake argla didre, yegl dugwa, Yoba ta udre, ye aglaumo di porabuka i ta paikrukwa. <verse eid="MRK 14:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MRK 14:64" />Ye God kagie ere kide ere togwa i, enene prikwa pre ene siragl we di prime? dugwa. Yegl dugo, yoba mudu makai si meglkwa i, di ikne ede, Ye si goramga i, kuno erumiwe digwa. <verse eid="MRK 14:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="MRK 14:65" />Yoba i yegl di kodigo, yoba tau ere mogl, Jisas guma dra eur sidre, gumuglo were si kegl di tedre, ye ere si, yegl digwa, Yoba ira ta ene sugwa i, ka kep ere, di pogl noro! digwa. Yegl digo, kibr nem tau dumo i sugl kan meglkwa i ama Jisas ere sigwa.<verse eid="MRK 14:65" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pita Jisas pre kan erekrie dugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">Matyu 26.69-75</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Luk 22.56-62</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Jon 18.15-18</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">18.25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MRK 14:66" />Ana yugu mina ibo Jisas kot ere teigo, Pita yugu meda kra togl suna moglko, tawa teigwa yoba bitno yagl i niglmo kogonmo abai ta ye moglmara udre, <verse eid="MRK 14:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MRK 14:67" />Pita ede ere gaiglmara pre moglko, kanugwa. Kandre, ye toro kan mogl, yegl dugwa, Ene ama Nasaret nem Jisas bogl akie meglkwa pamiwe dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 14:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="MRK 14:68" />Yegl dugo, Pita mane di, Ene ka dinga i, na ta pre pogl sikrika. Na ta maniwe dugwa. Pita yegl didre, ye ede pi togl dra yomara pi moglko, koduagle ta wi sugwa. <verse eid="MRK 14:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="MRK 14:69" />Wi sugo, nigl kogon abai ikra aglke kor Pita kandre, ye yoba magigl adigl meglkwa i yegl di togwa, Yagl magigl moglkwa iro Jisas yobamo ta moglmiwe dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 14:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MRK 14:70" />Yegl dugwa ba Pita kor dagl, Na ta maniwe dugwa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:70">Pita yegl didre, kuri ta moglko, yoba tau magigl meglkwa i, ede u Pita yegl di teigwa, Ene motnga i, yagl i duglo beglkwa yagl meglmara suna i motnga paugwa. Siragl pre ene Galili yoba ka dimere kuno diniwe digwa. <verse eid="MRK 14:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="MRK 14:71" />Yegl digo, Pita ka gigledi didre, Na yagl i ta pre kan erekriwe dugwa. Na ka kibi ta dibo, God na ere kide ere narabiwe dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 14:71" /><verse number="72" style="v" sid="MRK 14:72" />Yegl dugo, koduagle kumugl ta tabre aglke kor dagl wi sugwa. Wi sugo, Pita ye Jisas ka dugwa ikra, pre moglkwa. Jisas ye okna yegl di togwa, Koduagle kumugl ege suo wi sikran, ene ege suota na ta pre kan erekriwe dinatniwe dugwa. Ye ka yegl dugwa i, Pita poglo di prisre, ede meda pi, kai podo erukwa.<figure style="fig" alt="Cock crowing" file="HK00007D-rooster.tif" size="col" loc="14.72" copy="Horace Knowles, British Foreign and Bible Society" ref="14.72" /><verse eid="MRK 14:72" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MRK 15" />
  <para style="s">Jisas agre i pi, Pailat moglmara eigwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Matyu 27.1-2</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">27.11-14</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Luk 23.1-5</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Jon 18.28-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 15:1" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="Jerusalem" file="Map_Jerusalem_Kuman.jpg" size="span" copy="ESV" ref="15.1" />Ana taganamogl, tawa teigwa yoba bitno meglkwa i yeigo, Juda yoba yobano kade ikra yeigo, te God lomo beke teigwa yoba ya yoba tau ama Kaunsil mina meglkwa i mudu tabre makai si, ka di keglkwa. Ka di koglsre, Jisas si kane si i pi gavana Pailat moglmara edigwa. <verse eid="MRK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 15:2" />Edigo, Pailat ere mogl, Jisas kira pogl pre, yegl dugwa, Ene Juda yoba kingno motno? dugwa. Yegl dugo, Jisas di ikne ede, Ene dinga i, kuno diniwe dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 15:3" />Yegl dugo, tawa teigwa yoba bitno wagle ikra ere mogl, Jisas aglau kane kane erume digwa. <verse eid="MRK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 15:4" />Yegl digo, Jisas di ikne edekrukwa pre Pailat aglke kor yegl dugwa, Ene ta di ikne edekratno? Ene aglau kane kane etne digwa i, pitno mo prikitne? dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 15:5" />Pailat yegl dugwa ba Jisas ka swara kaima ta di ikne edekrukwa pre ye nagie kogl, kina gudu moglkwa.<verse eid="MRK 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pailat Jisas i pi ede prak mina si golo dugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Matyu 27.15-26</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luk 23.13-25</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Jon 18.39–19.16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 15:6" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="Jesus before Pilate" file="CN01822b.tif" size="col" copy="David C Cook" ref="15.6" />Ana bugla yugu swara swarade Juda yoba egeno kade i ugwa igne, Pailat ye Juda yoba taragl ta ere togwa. Ye kane yoba swara ta kagie daiglko, Pailat ye yoba i kane paikrabedi i meda edugwa. <verse eid="MRK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 15:7" />Ana igne i yagl ta kane yugu pai moglkwa, kagie Barabas we digwa. Yagl i ye yoba tau bogl ere mogl, Juda yoba mogl pere edinamnedi Rom yoba kuda bogl tedre, yoba tau si geglkwa pre ye yagl i, si kane sigo, kane yugu pai moglkwa. <verse eid="MRK 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 15:8" />Ana yoba mere kide ege i yomedi prisre, Pailat moglmara pi, erumere ikra ere norabedi di prikwa. <verse eid="MRK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 15:9" />Ye di priko, Pailat ye yegl di togwa, Na ene Juda yoba kingno i meda edibo, wakai praiglmo? dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 15:10" />Siragl pre Pailat yegl dugwa i, Juda yoba kade wagle ye Jisas yoko kiam sidre, ye na moglmara edigwa pamedi prukwa. <verse eid="MRK 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 15:11" />Ana Pailat yegl di prukwa ba tawa teigwa yoba bitno meglkwa i, ye yoba mere makai simara mudu kinano sidre, Ene gavana di te, yagl Jisas i meda edekre, yagl Barabas ikra i meda ede noro, dinaiglmedi ka beke teigwa. <verse eid="MRK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 15:12" />Ka yegl digo, Pailat ye di pre yegl dugwa, Ana yagl Jisas, ye Juda yoba Kingno moglme digwa i, na siragl ere tenagle? dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 15:13" />Yegl dugo, yoba mudu i, Ye ede prak mina si goglo! di, ka podo kaima digwa. <verse eid="MRK 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 15:14" />Yoba yegl digwa ba Pailat aglke kor yegl dugwa, Ye mabuno kide siragl mere erukwa pre na ye si goragle? dugwa. Dugwa ba yoba ka podo aimadi di pai moglsre, Ye ede prak mina si goglo! digwa. <verse eid="MRK 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 15:15" />Yegl digwa pre Pailat ere mogl, yoba mudu wakai praiglmedi yagl Barabas kane pamara i meda edidre, ye soldiamo Jisas duglnai sinaiglmedi di togo, ye duglnai sigwa. Duglnai sigo, Pailat ye i pi ede prak mina si golo dugwa.<verse eid="MRK 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Soldia Jisas kenaglmo sidre, ere kide ere teigwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:27-31">Matyu 27.27-31</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 19:2-3">Jon 19.2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 15:16" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="Jesus whipped" file="FM 185 Jesus Being Whipped_6inches_BW.jpg" size="col" copy="Foundation Matters" ref="15.16" />Ana Pailat soldiamo i, ye Jisas agre i ede pi Pailat yugumo toglmo suna edigwa. Togl suna edidre, ye soldia tau mere ye akie kogon erikwa i, mudu agle digo, wigwa. <verse eid="MRK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 15:17" />Wigo, ye Jisas gaglmo gugl edidre, gagl olto ta gogl yogwa i ede teigwa. Ede tedre, kewan kagigle ake kegmane ere, king bitno gagl erimere yegl ye bre mina padigl teigwa. <verse eid="MRK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 15:18" />Yegl ersre, ye bakagl te, yegl digwa, Juda yoba kingno, no ene di wakai yei tomniwe digwa. <verse eid="MRK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 15:19" />Yegl didre, ye megagle kuba bre mina ege mere sidre, eur si ogo nagie mina ede, goglkono bodugl, bitno magide teigwa. <verse eid="MRK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 15:20" />Ana Jisas agai gorabedi ere kide ere te kodidre, lap gogl ikra gugl ede, Jisas yene gaglmo aglke kor ede ikne ede tedre, ye ede prak mina si goramnedi agre i ede meda eigwa.<verse eid="MRK 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas ede prak mina sigwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Matyu 27.32-44</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luk 23.26-43</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Jon 19.17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 15:21" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="Crucifixion" file="CN01845B.TIF" size="span" copy="David C Cook" ref="15.21" />Ana soldia wagle Jisas auro i ede taun meda eigo, yagl ta taun meda mogl, ede suna unagledi ugo, tegigl yeigwa. Tegigl yeigo, soldia ye Jisas edemo prak kake tenatniwe digo, kake i ede ogwa. Yagl i, kagie Saimon we digo, ye dumo Sairini nem ta moglsre, wam suo Aleksander ya Rufus we digwa.<verse eid="MRK 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 15:22" />Ana soldia ye Jisas agre i ede pi dumo ta Golgota we dimara i, plau digwa. Kagie Golgota i, mem paugwa, Bre Yobuglo Dumo. <verse eid="MRK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 15:23" />Ye dumo i udre, nigl wain tau giugl marasin ta myr we digwa i bogl toide i swara edigwa i, Jisas nenabedi erikwa ba ye marasin i ta nekrukwa. <verse eid="MRK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 15:24" />Ta nekruko, soldia wagle ye Jisas ede prak mina si padiglsre, ye kuguglmo gaglmo swara swarade inamnedi kas mere yegl sigwa.<verse eid="MRK 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 15:25" />Ana ye Jisas ede prak mina sigwa i, tagna mogl, 9 klok mere yegl yogwa. <verse eid="MRK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 15:26" />Te, yoba aglauno bogl padigl, padigl erimere yegl, Jisas pre ama yegl bogl padiglkwa, Juda Yoba Kingno moglmiwe di, yegl bogl padiglkwa. <verse eid="MRK 15:26" /><verse number="27-28" style="v" sid="MRK 15:27-28" />Ana ye Jisas ede prak mina simara i, kunogl gogl yoba suo ta ogo wo kra sidre, ta kodo kra akie si padiglkwa.<verse eid="MRK 15:27-28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 15:29" />Ana Jisas ede prak mina pai moglko, yoba konbauna iro ya erikwa i, ye kagie ere kide ersre, bitno pia si, yegl digwa, Aya, ene God yugumo si gur di atne edidre, ege suota mina kor kenagle dinga i, <verse eid="MRK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 15:30" />ene enene ere idre, ede prak kide kodo, ede atne wo! digwa. <verse eid="MRK 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 15:31" />Kuno yegl tawa teigwa yoba bitno meglkwa i ya te, God lomo beke teigwa yoba ama Jisas kenaglmo sidre, yene di ikne ikne ede, yegl digwa, Yagl i, ye yoba pere ere yugwa ba ye yene ere inabuka i kuno ta erekrukwa paugwa. <verse eid="MRK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 15:32" />Ye God Kere Yugwa Yagle, Israel kingno kaima moran, erme ede prak kide kodo, ede atne wo do! Ede atne unan, no kandre, ye pre medramniwe digwa. Te, kunogl gogl yoba akie ede prak mina sigwa i, dimere kuno yegl Jisas kenaglmo si miurka.<verse eid="MRK 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas goglkwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Matyu 27.45-56</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luk 23.44-49</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Jon 19.28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 15:33" />Ana ermine belo mere yegl, dumo magigl i mim mudu ake wai di, pai mogl ogo, ade kwia 3 klok mere yogwa. <verse eid="MRK 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 15:34" />Ana ade kwia 3 klok yogo, Jisas ka podo di, yegl dugwa, Eloi, Eloi, lama sabaktani dugwa. Ye ka dugwa i mabuno yegl paugwa, Na Godna, na Godna, ene siragl pre na mokon natne?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Giglage 22.1</char></note> dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 15:35" />Ana Jisas ka yegl dugo, yoba tau magigl adigl meglkwa i prisre, Prio. Ye ka kep yagl Elaija agle dumiwe digwa. <verse eid="MRK 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 15:36" />Yegl digo, yoba ta ye muku di ede pi giagin ta idre, wain nuglo ku erukwa tau giagin mina si bai, buko mina padiglsre, i pi Jisas moglmara bi di nenabedi togo, nogwa. Nogo, yagl i aglke kor yegl dugwa, Ana Elaija u, ye i atne edenabo mo edekrabo mo i, nono kanamniwe di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 15:37" />Ana Jisas yegl pai moglsre, ka podo ta didre, goglkwa.<verse eid="MRK 15:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 15:38" />Ana Jisas goglko, lap podo ta tawa teigwa yugu yugugl kra keglkwa i, mitna ibo yei, suna wom si argla di ede ime u i koglo koglo edugwa.<figure style="fig" alt="Veil being torn" file="CN01843B.TIF" size="span" loc="15.38" copy="David C Cook" ref="15.38">Jisas goglko, Tempel lap argla dugwa</figure> <verse eid="MRK 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 15:39" />Yegl eruko, te, yagl ta soldia bitno moglkwa i, ye Jisas goglmara gumamugl adigl moglsre, Jisas siragl mere goglkwa i kanugwa. Kandre, yegl dugwa, Yagl i ka kaima God Wam moglmiwe dugwa.<verse eid="MRK 15:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 15:40" />Ana Jisas goglkwa igne i abu tau ama kuri ta eglke iro mogl, kan meglkwa. Abu i, ta kagie Maria we digwa, dumo Makdala mam i moglko, te Maria ta, Jems Kebra ya Josep mano i moglko, te abu Salome ama moglko, erukwa. <verse eid="MRK 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 15:41" />Jisas okna distrik Galili suna wanugwa igne, abu i ye duglo boglsre, ye ake ple di teigwa. Te, abu tau mere ama Jisas bogl akie ede dumo Jerusalem akie wigwa i ama ye goglkwa kan meglkwa.<verse eid="MRK 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas ogo nagie i pi kobuglo mur yeigwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Matyu 27.57-61</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 23:50-55">Luk 23.50-55</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Jon 19.38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 15:42" />Ana Jisas goglkwa igne i wakan kade tagna yenabuka pre yoba kaya mokna ya nigl, ede ki, ede yugugl ede yeigwa ege yogwa. Ege i yogo, min panagledi eruko, <verse eid="MRK 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 15:43" />yagl ta kagie Josep we digwa i, ye dumo Arimatea nem ta moglkwa, ye ere mogl, kudugl goglkwa ake bi didre, ede Rom Gavna Pailat moglmara ogwa. Yagl i Kaunsil mina moglsre, yagl kade ta moglkwa. Te, ye ama God yoba bitno mogl, ye suglno morabuka ege i unabedi pre ye sugl moglkwa yagl ta moglkwa. Ana ye ede pi Pailat moglmara pidre, Jisas nagie i pi kobuglo mur yenagledi di prukwa. <verse eid="MRK 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 15:44" />Yegl di pruko, Pailat ere mogl, Jisas ye tabre goglmo mo goglkrumo mo di, kina gudu prisre, yagl ta soldia tau bitno moglkwa ikra agle dugo, ugwa. Ugo, Pailat ye di pre, Jisas goglmo mo goglkrume? dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 15:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 15:45" />Yegl dugo, soldia bitno moglkwa i Goglmiwe dugo, Pailat prisre, yagl Josep i di te, Jisas nagie pi i atne edo dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 15:46" />Yegl dugwa pre Josep pi lap kruo olto ta topo sidre, Jisas nagie ede prak mina i atne ede, lap were tedre, ye i pi kobuglo mur ta yoba padramnedi pere yeimara i pi atne yogwa. Yedre, ye kobuglo podo paglkane ta ake nu si yu, kobuglo dra si kegl dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 15:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 15:47" />Te, ye kobuglo mur yomara i, Maria, dumo Makdala mam moglkwa i yogo, Maria ta Josep mam ikra bogl akie kanibrika.<verse eid="MRK 15:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MRK 16" />
  <para style="s">Jisas adigl u kor ogwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Matyu 28.1-8</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luk 24.1-12</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Jon 20.1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 16:1" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="Stone rolled away" file="cn01850B.tif" size="col" copy="David C Cook" ref="16.1" />Ana Sabat ege dudugo, Maria, dumo Makdala mam ikra yogo, Maria, Jems mam yogo, te abu Salome ikra yogo, ye ere mogl, kugo nuglo tau demene wakai erukwa i pi Jisas nagie mina kugo ere tenamnedi topo sigwa. <verse eid="MRK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 16:2" />Topo si yei, paigwa, Sande igne kamun tagekruko, ye ede pi kobuglo mur Jisas atne yeimara i enamnedi pi kamun tagugwa igne plau digwa. <verse eid="MRK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 16:3" />Ana ye bage pi meglkwa igne, yene di pre yegl digwa, Kobuglo podo paglkane ta kobuglo dra si kegl dugwa ikra, ira ake nu si eglke ede norabe? di, yegl digwa. <verse eid="MRK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 16:4" />Ye ka yegl didre, ye ede pi Jisas kobuglo mur yeimara magigl pi kan mitna ede, kanigwa, kobuglo paglkane podo kide ikra ake nu si eglke edigwa yogo, kanigwa. <verse eid="MRK 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 16:5" />Ye kandre, ye ede kobuglo mur atne eigwa. Atne pi kanigwa i, yagl kulu ta ye ogono wo kra ame di moglko, kanigwa. Yagl i, gagl suna kruo, olto ta edugwa. Ye yagl i kandre, kudugl geglkwa.<verse eid="MRK 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 16:6" />Kudugl geglko, yagl i yegl di togwa, Ene kudugl goglkrio! dugwa. Ene Jisas, dumo Nasaret nem, ye ede prak mina si geglkwa i dokigwa ba ye magigl i ta moglkrukwa. Ye adigl u kor ogwa. Ene u ye ogo nagie yeimara i, kanio! dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 16:7" />Te, ene ede pi ye duglo beglkwa yagl ya Pita yegl di teo, Jisas okna di tomere mere ye ede okna pi distrik Galili omiwa. Ene pi distrik Galili ye kanaiglmiwe di, yegl di teo! dugwa.<verse eid="MRK 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 16:8" />Ana ye ka yegl di kodugo, abu wagle ikra wai kugl, nagino nuglo didre, ede meda pi kobuglo mur yomara i kide kodo, teke ede eigwa. Ye kudugl geglkwa pre teke pi yoba ta di tekrikwa.<verse eid="MRK 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Maria, dumo Makdala mam ikra, Jisas kanugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:9-10">Matyu 28.9-10</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 20:11-18">Jon 20.11-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 16:9" />Ana Jisas adigl u kor ogwa igne i Sande eduer kana yogwa. Ye adigl u kor pidre, yoba ta moglmara komono kana plau dugwa i, Maria, dumo Makdala mam ikra moglmara plau dugwa. Abu i, okna murubuglo kide 7-pela ye moglmara suna meglko, Jisas ye di meda edugwa. <verse eid="MRK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 16:10" />Ana Jisas ye abu i moglmara plau dugo, abu i ye ede pi yagl tau okna Jisas bogl akie wanigwa ikra meglmara di tenagledi ogo, yagl i ye Jisas mirie gogl, kai ere meglko, kanugwa. Kandre, Jisas ye moglmara plau dugo, kanugwa i, ye di togwa. <verse eid="MRK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 16:11" />Ye di te, Jisas adigl u kor ogo, na kaniwe dugwa ba yagl wagle i, ye ka dugwa i pre mediglkrikwa.<verse eid="MRK 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas duglo beglkwa yagl suo konbauna pi miurko, Jisas ye ebrara ogwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 24:13-35">Luk 24.13-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 16:12" />Ana okuo, Jisas ye duglo biurka yagl suo miurara ama plau dugwa. Yagl suo i, ye dumo kade Jerusalem kide kodo, ede meda enabugledi konbauna pi miurko, Jisas ye ogo nagie u pere ta ogo, ye ede u yoba ta mere yegl pidre, ye ebrara plau dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 16:13" />Plau dugo, yagl suo i okuo ere mogl, yagl i ye Jisas moglmiwedi kanibrika. Kandre, ye ede ikne pi Jisas duglo beglkwa yagl tau meglkwa i di tebrika ba ye yagl suo kano i ama pre mediglkrikwa.<verse eid="MRK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yagl meglmara udre, kogonmo eraiglmedi dedugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Matyu 28.16-20</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luk 24.36-49</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Jon 20.19-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 16:14" />Ana okuo, Jisas duglo beglkwa yagl 11-pela kaya mokna ne meglko, Jisas ye meglmara plau dugwa. Plau didre, yagl 11-pela i ka togwa. Ye ka togwa i, okna Jisas adigl u kor ogo, yoba tau ye kandre, ye di teigwa ba yagl wagle i ye yoba kano pre mediglkre, nomano gigle dugwa i pre ye ka togwa. <verse eid="MRK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 16:15" />Te, Jisas ama ere mogl, ye di te, yegl dugwa, Ene ede uglo koglo koglo pi na kana wakai yogwa i, yoba mudu di teo dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 16:16" />Yoba ta pre mediglsre, nigl burabuka i, God ye ere inabuka. Yoba ta pre medrabuka i, God ye ere inabuka ba yoba ta pre mediglkrabuka i, God ye ka tage tenabiwe dugwa. <verse eid="MRK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 16:17" />Ana yoba pre medraiglkwa i, ye ama kimagl tau yegl eraiglkwa, ye na drana idre, murubuglo kide yoba meglmara suna meglkwa i di meda edidre, ye ka dinaiglkwa i, yoba pere pere kano i mina tau dinaiglkwa. <verse eid="MRK 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 16:18" />Te, ye toki kide ta akenaiglmo mo nigl kide ne geglkwa ta nebi, i ye si goglkrabuka. Yegl ersre, ye ama yoba kide sinaiglkwa i ye akibi, ye kideno aragan erabiwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="MRK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">God Jisas agre i ede heven ibo ogwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 24:50-53">Luk 24.50-53</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Aposel 1.9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 16:19" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="Ascension" file="CN01883B.TIF" size="span" copy="David C Cook" ref="16.19" />Ana Yagl Kade Jisas ere mogl, ye duglo beglkwa yagl i ka di te kodugo, God ye agre i ede heven ibo ogwa. Agre i ede heven ibo ogo, Jisas ye God ogo wo kra ame di moglkwa. <verse eid="MRK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 16:20" />Yegl eruko, ye duglo beglkwa yagl wagle i, ye ede dumo koglo koglo pi, ka mabuno di teigo, Yagl Kade ye ake ple di tedre, yoba ye ka kaima dimedi praiglmedi ye ama kimagl tau eraiglmedi yobuglo togwa.<verse eid="MRK 16:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 16" />
</usx>